min-height:1.5em">Build a marketing function for the AI era. Design, hire, and lead a lean, high-performing team that uses AI and modern tooling to deliver outsized output and measurable business impact. This is your chance to build a model for what modern enterprise marketing looks like.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Raise the bar on every touchpoint. Ensure every sales deck, digital channel, and message reflects the polish, precision, and credibility expected by €1B+ revenue organizations.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What you need to succeed</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">6–7 years of enterprise marketing or brand strategy experience, with a proven track record of translating complexity into clarity for enterprise buyers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep experience across Content, PR, Events, and Product Marketing, with a direct focus on generating pipeline, sourcing MQLs, and improving enterprise conversion rates.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated success driving top-of-funnel lead generation and boosting conversion rates by creating targeted content that resonates with ESG, procurement, and executive stakeholders at multinational companies.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience managing and empowering marketing talent to produce high-quality, high-impact work with a small, efficient headcount.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">German fluency (spoken and written) is a strong plus.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience with Salesforce and Pardot to build, execute, and measure marketing campaigns is also a bonus.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>The hiring process</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An intro call with the People Team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A call with our CEO, Magnus</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A call with our CRO, Juliane Sterzl</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A panel interview with senior stakeholders</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What's in it for you at CEEZER?</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A mission that matters:</strong> Work alongside international teams combining finance, tech, and climate science professionals to direct capital toward the world's most critical climate assets.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Accelerated growth:</strong> We are scaling fast, and your career will too. Take opportunities to lead cross-functional initiatives and expand your strategic influence.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>True ownership:</strong> We are building in a brand-new market, meaning many of our best practices don’t exist yet. If you see a better workflow, tool, or strategy, you have the autonomy and backing to build it.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>An empowering environment:</strong> We bring together diverse global perspectives, knowing that solving complex climate challenges requires a wide mix of backgrounds and expertise.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Real enterprise impact:</strong> Transform how global corporates approach sustainability. CEEZER hosts 50Mt+ of vetted carbon credits across all pathways, all backed by sophisticated data and institutional-grade risk management.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A net-zero career:</strong> We practice what we preach. From your first day, we fully offset your personal and professional carbon footprint because sustainability is how we operate.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>Excited to create impact with us?</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you don't meet every requirement but have <strong>exceptional strengths</strong> that could make you <strong>excel in this role