stomer value across a long-tail, multi-region customer segment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Take full strategic and operational ownership of the new <strong>SoSafe Education Program</strong>, defining its roadmap, curriculum strategy, and rollout execution, supported by 1 fully dedicated individual</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Personally design and deploy program-driven retention strategies that directly impact GRR and NRR performance targets across global accounts.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Team Leadership, Coaching &amp; Operations</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead, mentor, and actively coach a multilingual, global team of individual contributors, maintaining proximity to the work and leading by example.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Foster a high-bar culture focused on individual accountability, coachability, data-driven decisions, and operational excellence.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build scalable frameworks, workflows, and automated processes to ensure consistent program quality across global regions.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>AI, Technology &amp; Cross-Functional Alignment</strong></h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leverage AI tools, automation technologies, and customer analytics to streamline workflows, optimize program efficiency, and scale output.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner closely with the broader Customer Success team, Marketing, Product, and Sales to eliminate friction in customer journeys and align strategic priorities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with Marketing to manage clear handoffs between community/advocacy initiatives and education programs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own program-level KPIs such as adoption, engagement and retention impact. Add experiments and a clear link from program activity to GRR/NRR movement.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>What makes you a great fit:</