&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-EMEA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (MAP/VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click “Apply now” below, your information is sent to MAP/VML. To learn more about how we process your personal data during when you apply for a role with us, on how you can update your information or have the information removed please read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wt-map.com/privacy-policy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;1be1ea03-7c74-4825-b023-8bda1dc2d911&quot;&gt;Privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wundermanthompson.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;02863cf9-cae6-4a11-b7f1-4f68ba8e0816&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/map/enterprise-architect-salesforce-marketing-cloud-london-326287","tags":["Technology & Innovation"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1792713326},{"slug":"director-product-workflow-work-management-261707","company_name":"Wpp","title":"Director, Product, Workflow & Work Management","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We unite cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel in a single company – powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open, to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We work with the world&#39;s most valuable brands and have global reach across 100+ markets, with deep local expertise.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our people are the key to our success. We&#39;re committed to fostering a culture of creativity, belonging and continuous learning, attracting and developing the brightest talent, and providing exciting career opportunities that help our people grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://eur02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwpp.com%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C02%7CErica.Durr%40wpp.com%7C9bf4566a65bc46a48ac008de749116ea%7C150b5e663d884dee83f6ed149b727a00%7C0%7C0%7C639076363668176216%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=Q9juosud56XGLThSFZ1NpPZd6FXpJPxV74OeRZWoh%2B4%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP.com.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;WPP’s Data &amp;amp; Technology Solutions is the WPP’s unified global data products and technology team. We work with our agencies and clients to build data-driven solutions and technology product to power marketing transformation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;WPP Open is our AI platform for marketing, it connects marketing professionals, data, tools and AI in a single place. WPP Open is the simplest, safest and fastest way to realize the benefits of scaled AI – delivering better-informed creative ideas faster and at scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Product professional to lead the evolution of Work Management capabilities within WPP Open, WPP&#39;s AI-powered platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;The candidate will have experience building or managing enterprise work management, project management and workflow automation. You will understand how large organizations plan, assign, execute, approve and measure work at scale, and how technology can remove friction from these processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Leveraging this expertise, you will closely collaborate with the broader product leadership team to ensure that strategy effectively aligns with and advances our overarching vision across the entire product portfolio and to provide our agencies and their clients with a competitive advantage through the application of data and technology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;This role requires a person who can balance strategic thinking with hands-on execution, helping shape how work gets done across WPP while ensuring Open can integrate seamlessly into the workflows our clients use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the vision, strategy and roadmap for Work Management capabilities within WPP Open, ensuring alignment with the broader Open platform strategy and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Leadership to shape a product roadmap, emphasizing value realization through lean and iterative methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Engineering, Design, UX to deliver a connected Work Management vision spanning briefing, project execution, approvals, and operational reporting. Set clear objectives with teams and ensure alignment of plans and workstreams to achieve them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions that connect work across teams and agents, reducing handoffs and improving visibility from brief to outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define product requirements for integrations with leading work management and collaboration platforms, understanding thier roadmaps to implement capabilities in close synchronisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide day-to-day vision, direction and motivation to the cross-functional product team, including product management, data analysts, engineers and product enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize data to drive product strategies and plans, gathering quantitative and qualitative feedback from users and stakeholders to enhance product adoption and usage continually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote best practices of Product Management and Ownership throughout the team, identifying and implementing areas for improvement. Offer guidance and coaching to Product Managers and Product Owners to elevate processes, tools, and ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support development teams through definition of requirements, product reviews, user acceptance testing, and sign-off against requirements and specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the voice of the customer by balancing platform priorities with the needs of agencies, operations teams and clients. Keep them up to date with strategic direction and the product roadmap, and communicate new product releases to ensure successful advocacy and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Product Management, Product Ownership, or related roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record delivering enterprise SaaS products, workflow platforms, work management solutions, or operational systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Project and task management, Workflow analysis, transformation and automation, Approval workflows, Agency best practice operations and delivery processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with working with work management platforms and understand how these tools are deployed and integrated within agencies, enterprises, and client organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in leading and implementing agile development frameworks for delivering technical products, coupled with experience collaborating with cross-functional and geographically dispersed teams and stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering products that integrate with third-party enterprise systems. Understanding of APIs, system integrations, workflow orchestration and data interoperability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with enterprise clients that require integration with proprietary or client-specific systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with AI-enabled workflow automation and agentic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re open&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;We are inclusive and collaborative; we encourage the free exchange of ideas; we respect and celebrate diverse views. We are open-minded: to new ideas, new partnerships, new ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re optimistic&lt;em&gt;:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;span id=&quot;628d56ad5d8a35dab853e65d9daa237c&quot; class=&quot;editor-module-hl-green-solid&quot;&gt;We believe&lt;/span&gt; in the power of creativity, technology and talent to create brighter futures or our people, our clients and our communities. We approach all that we do with conviction: to try the new and to seek the unexpected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re extraordinary:&lt;/strong&gt; we are stronger together: through collaboration we achieve the amazing. We are creative leaders and pioneers of our industry; we provide extraordinary every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;ll give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate, inspired people&lt;/strong&gt; – We aim to create a culture in which people can do extraordinary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale and opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; – We offer the opportunity to create, influence and complete projects at a scale that is unparalleled in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Challenging and stimulating work&lt;/strong&gt; – Unique work and the opportunity to join a group of creative problem solvers. Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(236, 240, 241);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please read our Privacy Notice (&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;https://www.wpp.com/en/careers/wpp-privacy-policy-for-recruitment&lt;/a&gt;) for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/wpp/director-product-workflow-work-management-261707","tags":["Technology & Innovation"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792713326},{"slug":"senior-manager-hr-process-excellence-london-396838","company_name":"Verve","title":"Senior Manager, HR Process Excellence","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a commercially minded&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, HR Process Excellence&lt;/strong&gt; to drive the design, optimisation and continuous improvement of HR processes across Verve Group.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the subject matter expert (SME) for HR process excellence, you will partner with HR leadership and leaders across the organisation. You will be identifying opportunities to improve the effectiveness of HR processes across the employee lifecycle. Key principles are simplicity and scalability as we embark on the next exciting stage of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a temp-to-perm role offering a hybrid working arrangement, with three days per week in our London office in Covent Garden.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Process Excellence &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the organisation&#39;s subject matter expert for HR process excellence, providing specialist guidance and thought leadership across a broad range of HR initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end assessment, design, redesign and optimisation of HR processes across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to eliminate inefficiencies, reduce complexity, remove duplication and improve process effectiveness, quality and user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge legacy processes and existing ways of working, driving a culture of simplification and scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery of HR Improvement Initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support multiple process improvement initiatives across HR, working across a portfolio of priorities that may include recruitment, onboarding, employee lifecycle management, HR operations, performance management, talent, reward and employee offboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop business cases, quantify benefits and define measurable success criteria for proposed improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee implementation of agreed process changes, ensuring solutions are practical, scalable and simple!&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Engagement &amp;amp; Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships across the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted adviser to senior stakeholders, providing expert recommendations on process design and improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance commercial impact with legal risk and bring together internal stakeholders to align on a path forward.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HR Technology, Data &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with HR Ops and Intelligence teams to identify opportunities for automation, workflow optimisation, self-service and improved use of HR systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure process improvements are designed with technology enablement and automation at their core.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote data-driven decision-making and the use of digital solutions to improve HR service across the entire employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change Management &amp;amp; Capability Building&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the adoption of redesigned processes through effective stakeholder engagement, communications, training and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip HR teams and process owners with the tools, frameworks and knowledge required to sustain improvements independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share best practices, lessons learned and reusable process improvement approaches across HR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a continuous improvement mindset, encouraging teams to challenge existing practices and take ownership of operational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in HR process improvement, change management/transformation. Ideally a consultancy background, either internal or external.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable experience leading end-to-end process improvement initiatives within a global, rapidly growing organisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of HR processes across multiple areas of the employee lifecycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multiple initiatives simultaneously, from initial assessment and solution design through to implementation and benefits realisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and influencing skills, with the credibility to engage and challenge senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable ability to lead change, influence adoption and embed sustainable improvements across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of process excellence methodologies this could include but not limited to Lean, Six Sigma, value stream mapping, root cause analysis and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, including the ability to interpret operational data, establish baselines and measure improvement outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of HR technology, workflow automation, digital self-service and the role of technology in enabling process transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, facilitation and presentation skills, with the ability to influence stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a few of the benefits waiting for you at Verve:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay healthy with our&lt;strong&gt; Bupa HealthCare Plan&lt;/strong&gt; with easy access to medical care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your long-term financial security with our &lt;strong&gt;Aviva Corporate Pension Scheme&lt;/strong&gt;, with Verve contributing 3% of your qualifying earnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pick what matters most to you in our &lt;strong&gt;Personalized Benefits Platform, &lt;/strong&gt;with a budget of&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;£50/month&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with &lt;strong&gt;25 paid vacation days + 3 Wellness days &lt;/strong&gt;throughout the year, in addition to the public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boost your professional knowledge with our annual training budget &amp;amp; internal webinars&lt;/strong&gt;… and even more reasons to join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/verve/senior-manager-hr-process-excellence-london-396838","tags":["General & Administrative"],"job_types":[],"location":"London","created_at":1792713323},{"slug":"agentic-ai-principal-london-196180","company_name":"thoughtworks","title":"Agentic AI Principal","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI Principal&lt;/strong&gt; to act as a senior technical authority and trusted client advisor for complex agentic AI transformation in the UK and Ireland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Operating at Principal level, you will shape enterprise AI strategy, define agentic architecture blueprints, lead high-value C-suite engagements and guide complex programmes from opportunity through delivery. You will bring deep hands-on credibility in multi-agent systems, governance and safeguards, while setting reusable patterns and raising capability across teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role has particular focus on sovereign, compliant and production-grade agentic AI for regulated UK enterprise environments, including financial services and telecommunications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI Advisory &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Shape and solution complex UKI pursuits, working with account, commercial and delivery leaders to translate client needs into differentiated propositions, credible architectures and executable delivery approaches that support regional pipeline conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design &amp;amp; Build Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Set the architecture direction for complex, production-grade agentic AI systems, including multi-agent workflows, orchestration, tool use, memory, context strategy, retrieval, evaluation, observability and enterprise integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Governance &amp;amp; Safeguards: &lt;/strong&gt;Establish reusable patterns for observability, auditability, traceability and control of agentic systems, enabling teams to demonstrate safe and reliable behaviour in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal-level leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Set reusable architecture patterns, engineering standards and governance practices across multiple teams and engagements, influencing the evolution of Thoughtworks’ agentic AI capability beyond an individual programme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design solutions appropriate for regulated UK environments, including financial services and telecommunications, with strong consideration of data sovereignty, privacy, security, responsible AI and applicable regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical and delivery leadership for complex programmes, maintaining sufficient hands-on involvement to validate architecture, unblock teams, manage technical risk and ensure successful execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction across multiple teams and initiatives, defining reusable patterns, frameworks and engineering standards for agentic AI delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide teams in balancing rapid experimentation with robust production engineering, including evaluation-driven development, testing, CI/CD, reliability, cost and performance optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, data, software engineering, enterprise architecture, governance and change specialists to design end-to-end solutions that deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate technical, organisational and governance challenges in enterprise AI adoption and define practical approaches to address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor senior engineers and technical leads, uplift broader engineering capability, and build confidence in agentic AI practices across specialists and generalists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging agentic AI technologies and frameworks and guide their responsible adoption based on client context, engineering quality and business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Thoughtworks&#39; agentic AI expertise in strategic client conversations, industry forums, partnerships and thought leadership where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in modern software engineering and Python, with a strong track record of setting standards for testing, CI/CD, observability, maintainability and production reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
