fortable making decisions with incomplete information and moving quickly anyway.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You own the outcome and you don’t wait for permission to fix what’s broken.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You enjoy working closely with people across multiple countries and time zones as part of one connected, global team, including flexing your hours occasionally to make that connection work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You know when to align and when to just decide. Collaboration isn't a way to avoid accountability.</p></li></ul><h2>Learn more about your team</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">SME &amp; Growth at Airwallex is about more than closing deals. We help small and mid-market businesses solve real financial challenges across borders: getting paid globally, managing multi-currency accounts, paying suppliers, and running spend across markets from a single platform. You're not selling a feature. You're helping founders and finance leaders replace fragmented financial operations with one global system that actually scales.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">It's a function for sellers who like to build, not follow a script: curious, resourceful, and comfortable figuring things out in markets that are still wide open. You get real autonomy to create value, build relationships, and move opportunities forward.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">If you want to sell a serious product, solve real problems for ambitious businesses, and build your career fast, this is a place to do it.</p><h2><strong>Applicant Safety Policy: Fraud and Third-Party Recruiters</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>To protect you from recruitment scams, please be aware that Airwallex will not ask for bank details, sensitive ID numbers (i.e. passport), or any form of payment during the application or interview process. All official communication will come from an @</em><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://airwallex.com"><