ight:1.5em">Ensure data quality and reporting accuracy for business reviews and decision-making</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Seller Success Manager, Analytics, and Product teams to implement scalable solutions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify opportunities to use AI and automation to improve efficiency and insight generation.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>Required Qualifications</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">3 to 5 years of experience in business operations, sales operations, business intelligence, or a similar role.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong analytical skills, SQL is a must, and experience with reporting and dashboard tools such as Google Sheets, Omni, Tableau, or Power BI.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience supporting commercial or account management teams with processes, tools, or performance tracking.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Interest in AI, automation, and process improvement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong sense of Ownership &amp; positive learning attitude are must-have</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Good organization &amp; communication skills, and not afraid of writing structured documents</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">English is no-brainers (fully professional capability in English). If you’re extra cool and speak more languages, bonus points for you!</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Please submit your CV in English.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Hiring Process</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">1. Screening Interview - 45min</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">2. Live case study Hiring Manager - 60min</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">3. Stakeholder interview - 45min</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">4. Leadership Interview - 45min</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">4. Culture Fit Interview - 45min</p><h2><s