&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordination &lt;/strong&gt;: Tu assures une communication et une coordination fluides entre tous les acteurs du projet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Animation digitale&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu pilotes le recrutement des participants, le ciblage des experts (mentors, jurys) et l&#39;animation de nos plateformes en ligne.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestration J-J&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu gères la logistique des temps forts et participes activement à la facilitation, animation et à la coordination générale le Jour-J.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production de Livrables&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu conçois les supports de communication (slides, briefs, kits) et structures les synthèses post-événements pour valoriser nos réalisations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤖 Ta mission bonus : AI Playground&lt;/strong&gt;. Tu testes et intègres des solutions IA/tech pour booster nos propres process et enrichir l&#39;expérience des participants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 Ton profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parcours :&lt;/strong&gt; Fin d&#39;études (Master 2) en École de commerce, Ingénieur, Université, IEP, Master Innovation, Management, Gestion de Projet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu as une vraie rigueur d&#39;organisation, excellent relationnel, autonomie et force de proposition. Tu as une appétence forte pour l&#39;innovation, l&#39;écosystème Tech/IA, la gestion d&#39;événements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outils&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu sais opérer Canva, des outils visuels (Klaxoon/Mural), Lemlist et tu joues souvent avec des outils d&#39;IA Générative (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues&lt;/strong&gt; : Français et Anglais courants (contexte international).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎁 Ce que nous t&#39;offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Immersion&lt;/strong&gt; : Le meilleur spot pour comprendre concrètement les enjeux et usages de l&#39;IA, la Tech et l’innovation de rupture aujourd&#39;hui.Réseau unique : Tu seras en contact direct des acteurs clé étatiques, de la tech, des startups, des écoles et de l&#39;industrie.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un cadre de travail stimulant&lt;/strong&gt; au sein d&#39;une équipe à taille humaine, dynamique, bienveillante et responsabilisante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Gratification compétitive, tickets resto, télétravail flexible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comment postuler ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Envoie-nous ton &lt;strong&gt;CV&lt;/strong&gt; accompagné d’un &lt;strong&gt;support de motivation original &lt;/strong&gt;(libre cours à ta créativité – points bonus pour une utilisation appropriée de solutions IA !).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quels que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.fr/jobs/companies/artefact/stage-assistant-project-manager-hackathons-innovation-f-h-9th-arrondissement-of-paris-75009-paris-493304","tags":["Artefact Open Innovation"],"job_types":[],"location":"9th arrondissement of Paris, 75009, Paris","created_at":1792691725},{"slug":"people-ops-ma-and-international-expansion-paris-france-273353","company_name":"Alan","title":"People ops - M&A and International Expansion","description":"<h2><strong>Health can’t wait</strong>. </h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">Not for symptoms to get worse. Not for a six‑month appointment. Not for a system to catch up. But that’s exactly how healthcare works today. You wait, until you can’t.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Alan exists to end the wait.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Health is a universal right, and we believe this right can only become real when it’s coupled with prevention. We need to stop treating health as something we repair and start treating it as something we build, every day. It’s not solely a question of willpower. It’s the healthcare system itself that needs to work for everyone, in a sustainable way.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">So we are building the<strong> new standard in prevention insurance. </strong>Alan is the first company that integrates insurance, prevention, and care into a single, acclaimed user experience.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are on an incredible journey to build a <strong>global leading company, with a </strong><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://alan.com/en/careers"><strong><u>unique culture</u></strong></a>. We already partner with 40K+ companies of all sizes, serving more than 1M+ members, and have reached €800M+ in ARR.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prevention as the new norm. That's what we're building with our team of 1000+ people. If it speaks to you: we're hiring across France, Spain, Belgium, and Canada. And beyond.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>The M&amp;A and International Expansion role</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Alan is diversifying its activities in the fields of healthcare, prevention and insurance through mergers and acquisitions, and is actively expanding internationally. In addition, Alan recruits talent worldwide and enables its employees to work remotely in complete safety.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">“Alaner, everywhere”. The role makes sure each acquisition and each country opening is legally secure, fast and humane: from HR due diligence, to transferring employment contracts, to fully integrating the people who join us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll join the Expansion crew inside the People team. You'll work closely with the crew owner, and with Corporate, Finance, team Leads and General Managers involved in each deal.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>The People team</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The People team is made up of 13 people who work in an environment shaped by Alan's Leadership Principles. Every one of them is a genuine fan of our products (Culture being one of them) and deeply committed to Alan's Prevention and Health mission.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">The team covers Learning and Development, Payroll and Admin, Employee Experience and Operational Efficiency, Compliance and Employment Law, Comp and Ben, and now M&amp;A and International Expansion.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">It is a generalist team: everyone shares three core missions, namely People on-call (answering the day to day questions from Alaners, which is now AI-powered), individual situation management, and HRBP responsibilities. This represents roughly 50% of our time. Then each person owns one or more cross-functional topics depending on their flavour. In your case: M&amp;A and expansion.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Your missions</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">On top of the core missions shared across the People team, you will work on a very diverse range of high-impact topics:</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will <strong>own to the People workstream of M&amp;A transactions</strong> from due diligence to integration, alongside the crew and in close collaboration with the Corporate team, Legal, Finance and the business owners of each deal.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Depending on the nature of the deal, you will own:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>HR due diligence:</strong> reviewing headcount, employment contracts, collective agreements, compensation &amp; benefits, liabilities and risks of target companies, and flagging red flags clearly to the deal team;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Transferring employment contracts </strong>in France and abroad, and choosing the right path for each deal and country;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Integrating acquired teams: </strong>day-1 and first-months plans, harmonising contracts and benefits, communicating with acquired employees, onboarding them into Alan's way of working;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You will support the people transition of acquired teams,</strong> working with the crew and leads on team set-up, keeping key talents, and supporting every individual situation with care;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Working with<strong> external advisors</strong> (law firms, HR advisory, relocation and EoR providers): writing clear briefs and challenging their advice.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Also:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Opening new countries on the People side</strong>: entity vs employer of record, compliant local contracts, benefits and payroll partners</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will handle <strong>international relocations and cross-border situations for Alaners moving or working between countries</strong> (visas, social security, tax, type of contract);</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Building reusable playbooks</strong> (HR due diligence checklist, integration playbook, "country opening – People" checklist) so each new deal is faster than the last</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Taking on global and cross-border individual situations</strong> (mobility, work from anywhere, sensitive cases)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Raising the team's expertise</strong>: sharing your knowledge of employment law and M&amp;A practices with the crew and the wider People team</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Leveraging AI and automation</strong> to multiply the impact of your work</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2><strong>Outcomes within your first months in the team</strong></h2><h2><strong>By 2.5 months:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are autonomous on day-to-day People on-call requests;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have mapped our current M&amp;A and country-opening practices and shared a first list of gaps and quick wins;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have contributed to the People workstream of at least one live deal or country opening (due diligence, contract transfer or integration);</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have contributed to our reusable playbook (e.g. HR due diligence checklist);</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have shadowed and been reverse-shadowed on individual situation management.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>By 5 months:</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Depending on the ongoing projects, you own the People workstream of a deal end to end, from due diligence to integration, with the crew as a sounding board;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have run, or co-run, one talent density assessment and the parting ways cases that came with it;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You handle cross-border individual situations without supervision;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Your playbooks are used by the crew and by Legal / Finance on new deals;</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leads and crew members come to you as the go-to expert on these topics.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h1><strong>Is this what you are looking for?</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>You may be a great fit for this role if:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You have around 5 years of experience focused on HR M&amp;A and integration topics, for example in a reputable HR advisory firm or in an HR team that focuses on th