ic), at senior and managing director level.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Map the ecosystem, prioritize interlocutors, and design Alan's engagement strategy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be the consistent Alan voice that brokers recognize: someone who shows up, follows through, and is known as easy to deal with without giving away what shouldn't be given.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Partnership with Alan's Enterprise &amp; Commercial work</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be a partner to our Enterprise Sales and KAM teams on every broker situation: drive strategic decisions deal by deal and turn ecosystem knowledge into commercial leverage.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Introduce the right broker contacts at the right moment in the commercial cycle,  transforming relationship capital into pipeline access on large and very large accounts.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Share Alan's value and positioning with broker partners to help them understand, represent, and actively promote Alan within their client portfolios.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hold the line on our non-negotiables while finding creative ways to make the collaboration work for both sides.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Sector Engagement &amp; Anticipation</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Follow the broker market at deal level and ecosystem level: who is growing, who is consolidating, where portfolio shifts are happening, and what it means for Alan's pipeline and positioning.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be a sharp, early internal voice on where the broker market is heading and on the implications for Alan's strategy, including on consolidation, regulation, and competitive dynamics.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>