e.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Passionate about software craftsmanship: Strong understanding of software development principles, Clean Code and Clean Architecture.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Product thinking: Ability to translate business problems into precise requirements, specifications and ultimately into code.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Entrepreneurial mindset: link your daily work to team and company goals, balance cost and benefit, deliver high-quality solutions efficiently.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ownership: take responsibility for your technical work, for the product we build and the team we shape.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Team-oriented: proactively support team goals, close gaps.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Abstraction and efficient communication: simplify complex systems, identify core concepts, communicate complex ideas to different stakeholders. </p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>What you'll get</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Full ownership.</strong> You own the product's roadmap, from business problem to shipped code.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>End-to-end impact.</strong> You're on a team that owns what it builds, start to finish.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A modern, varied tech stack.</strong> Continuous learning as the platform scales.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><p style="min-height:1.5em">Learn more about blp and our values at <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://blp.digital/company/careers">blp.digital/company/careers</a>.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/blp-digital-ag/software-engineer-expenses-team-zurich-72683","tags":["Engineering"