n ontwikkeld.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Ons R&amp;D-team, dat inmiddels bestaat uit meer dan 30 technische specialisten, staat altijd open voor jonge talenten die willen groeien en zich verder willen ontwikkelen. Tijdens elke stageperiode bieden we meerdere plekken aan voor studenten in de volgende deelgebieden:&nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Backend development;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Frontend development;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Embedded Software Development;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">DevOps;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Security;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Software testing.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Hierbij kom je aanraking met onze tech-stack, bestaande uit:&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Python;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">C++;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Rust;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Angular;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Typescript;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Playwright;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Zabbix;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Linux;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">MariaDB;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Kubernetes;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">SALT.&nbsp;</span><br></p></li></ul><p><span style="color:#646363">Uiteraard staan we altijd open voor inbreng van studenten op het gebied van nieuwe tooling, frameworks en technieken.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Welke opdrachten kan je verwachten?</span><br></p><ul><li><p><strong><em><span style="color:#555555">Studio for e-mail</span></em></strong></p></li></ul><p><span style="color:#575757">Door de aanhoudende groei van het aantal IXON Cloud-gebruikers neemt de diversiteit aan specifieke wensen toe. Een veelgehoorde behoefte is het personaliseren van e-mailberichten die vanuit het platform naar de eindgebruikers worden verstuurd. Momenteel zijn de aanpassingsmogelijkheden beperkt tot enkel de kleuren en logo's. Het doel van deze opdracht is om klanten volledige controle te bieden over de vormgeving en inhoud van hun e-mails. Om dit te realiseren, wordt een intuïtieve e-mailstudio ontwikkeld waarmee de gebruiker eenvoudig en naar eigen inzicht berichten kan opstellen en beheren.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#646363">Support Beckhoff ADS via pull application (Embedded Software Development)</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><em><span style="color:#646363">Implementeer ondersteuning voor het Beckhoff ADS-protocol in C++ om de compatibiliteit van de IXON data pipeline te vergroten. Je realiseert de volledige koppeling op de gateway en maakt data-logging eenvoudig configureerbaar in de fleet manager.</span></em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><ul><li><p><strong><span style="color:#646363">Het versnellen van End-to-End (E2E) testen (Software testing)</span></strong></p></li></ul><p><em><span style="color:#646363">Optimaliseer de End-to-End testomgeving van de IXON Cloud om de feedbackcyclus en release-snelheid voor ontwikkelaars te verhogen. Je identificeert knelpunten en implementeert versnellingsoplossingen binnen de GitLab CI/CD-pipeline.</span></em><br></p><p><strong><span style="color:#646363">Hier herken jij jezelf in&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Je bent een HBO student in de richting van (Embedded) Software Development, Security of aanverwant en bent op zoek naar een (afstudeer)stage met impact. Je hebt een passie voor het ontwikkelen van toffe softwareoplossingen en krijgt graag de vrijheid om nieuwe dingen uit te proberen. Daarbij ga je niet voor shortcuts, maar werk je gestructureerd aan kwalitatieve oplossingen. Daarnaast ben je een echte teamplayer, die daardoor moeiteloos meedraait in een van onze SCRUM teams.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style="color:#646363">Dit hebben wij jou te bieden&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Een mooie stagevergoeding;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Een relaxte werkomgeving met jonge en ambitieuze developers, met wie je altijd kunt sparren over de nieuwste technologieën;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Flexibele werktijden en de mogelijkheid om thuis te werken;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Doorgroeimogelijkheden binnen onze organisatie.&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><span style="color:#646363">Klaar om impact te maken?</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Connect met IXON en ontdek onze stagemogelijkheden! Solliciteren kan snel en gemakkelijk, door te klikken op de onderstaande knop.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Behoefte aan meer details? Neem contact op met onze interne recruiter, Joey van Elsen, door te bellen naar +31628819109 of stuur een mail naar ----- style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/ixon-cloud/stage-software-development-beugen-261985","tags":["Internships"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Beugen, Noord-Brabant, Netherlands","created_at":1792701101},{"slug":"stagiair-business-control-beugen-268509","company_name":"IXON Cloud","title":"Stagiair Business Control","description":"<p><span style="color:#646363">Ben jij er klaar voor om impact te hebben op een van de belangrijkste sectoren in de wereld? Bij IXON connecten wij machines met hun makers. Door machinebouwers wereldwijd toegang te geven tot hun machines en data zorgen wij voor een revolutie in industrial automation. Met onze end-to-end oplossing, bestaande uit een cloudplatform met geïntegreerde remote access, geven wij machinebouwers de tools en technologie in handen om hun businessmodellen te transformeren en daarmee toekomstbestendig te blijven. Dit alles met als doel: Efficiëntere productie met de laagst mogelijke impact op de wereld.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br></p><p><strong><span style="color:#021752">Hier krijg jij energie van</span></strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Tijdens deze stage van een half jaar (startende in februari) ga je aan de slag met de uitrol van Business Control binnen onze R&amp;D-afdeling, waar dit op dit moment nog niet aanwezig is. Wij geloven dat het geluk van de mens hem zit in het hebben van autonomie, een doel (purpose) en de kans om te groeien. Business control heeft daar een enorme impact op! Doordat de behaalde resultaten zichtbaar worden, kunnen deze gevierd worden en zie je direct hoe je zelf presteert en groeit binnen het bedrijf. Business control op R&amp;D is best een uitdaging, want regels code tellen is niet de oplossing en de opbrengst van nieuwe producten is vaak nog lastig in te schatten. Jij gaat de uitdaging aan om toch controle te krijgen over de business!</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Hoewel geen dag hetzelfde is, houd jij je tijdens een gemiddelde werkweek onder andere bezig met de volgende activiteiten:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#1059D2">De bestaande rapportagestructuur en kosten binnen de R&amp;D-afdeling in kaart brengen;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#1059D2">Het maken van een concreet uitrolplan (waaronder het bepalen van KPI's, rapportages en reviews);</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#1059D2">Meehelpen met rapportageverbeteringen en overkoepelend meekijken op de afdeling;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#1059D2">Wanneer er tijd is: een pilot draaien met één van onze teams om jouw theorie in de praktijk te brengen.</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><span style="color:#021752">Dit maakt jou succesvol in deze rol&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p><br></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Jij past perfect bij de pioniersgeest van onze organisatie. Dit betekent dat je niet bang bent om buiten de lijntjes te kleuren, initiatief te nemen en daardoor dus graag aan de slag gaat met nieuwe inzichten en projecten. Daarnaast ben je analytisch sterk, werk je graag zelfstandig en ben je van nature erg nieuwsgierig.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Wat wij van jou verwachten:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#1059D2">Je bent een Bachelor student in de richting Finance, Bedrijfseconomie of soortgelijk;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#1059D2">Je bent beschikbaar voor een stageduur van een half jaar (startende in februari);</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#1059D2">Je hebt de gedrevenheid om een complexe uitdaging, zoals het meetbaar maken van R&amp;D, aan te vliegen.</span><br><br></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#021752">Dit hebben wij jou te bieden</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Binnen deze rol krijg je de vrijheid en kans om een cruciale rol te spelen in het succes van een organisatie met enorme internationale marktpotentie. Je maakt deel uit van een stimulerende en internationale werkomgeving, waarin je kunt samenwerken met getalenteerde en ambitieuze professionals en de ruimte krijgt om jezelf verder te ontwikkelen. Uiteraard belonen we je inzet met een mooie stagevergoeding en uitstekende secundaire voorwaarden, zoals:</span></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Een goede stagevergoeding;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Thuiswerkmogelijkheden;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">De kans om de werkelijke impact van autonomie, een doel (purpose) en groei te ervaren;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#646363">Een flexibele en relaxte werkomgeving.</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong><span style="color:#021752">Klaar om impact te maken?</span></strong></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Begin jouw reis en connect met IXON! Solliciteren kan snel en gemakkelijk, door te klikken op de onderstaande knop.</span></p><p><span style="color:#646363">Behoefte aan meer details? Neem contact op met onze interne recruiter, Joey van Elsen, door te bellen naar +31628819109 of stuur een mail naar ----- style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/ixon-cloud/stagiair-business-control-beugen-268509","tags":["Internships"],"job_types":["Student college","internship"],"location":"Beugen, Noord-Brabant, Netherlands","created_at":1792701101},{"slug":"senior-implementation-specialist-dutch-speaking-amsterdam-188667","company_name":"Perk","title":"Senior Implementation Specialist - Dutch Speaking","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Us</strong><br /><br />Perk (formerly TravelPerk) is the intelligent platform for travel and spend management. Built to tackle the time-consuming, manual work that gets in the way of real work, our tools automate everything from travel bookings to expenses, invoice processing, and more. By eliminating this shadow work that wastes hours, erodes morale, and saps innovation, we're on a mission to power real work, with real impact.<br /><br />We're trusted by more than 12,000 companies worldwide, including Bolt, GoCardless, and Fabletics, and we're tackling the 7 hours of lost productivity per employee each week, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.perk.com/shadow-work-report">a $1.7 trillion problem</a>.<br /><br />Founded in 2015, Perk has grown into a global company of more than 1,800 people across 12 offices globally, with headquarters in London and Boston. We combine innovation, control, and simplicity to transform how businesses work and how people feel at work.<br /><br />At Perk, we're driven by our values, like being an owner, delivering a 7-star experience, and working as one team. We value curiosity, purpose, and mindset, not just knowledge, to unlock the power in your potential. Our talent team brings together leading minds from the travel, fintech, and SaaS industries, representing over 70 countries. If you're excited about having a real impact and shaping how millions of people experience work, we'd love you on the team.<br /><br />Visit <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://www.perk.com">www.perk.com</a> to learn more.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div><div style="left:0px;width:100%;height:0px;position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe src="https://embedded-media.ashbyhq.com/embed/4899a966-8724-4480-958f-7271e5dc2807/f3e1915d-e346-4987-a1fb-9c447e8786c0" style="top:0px;left:0px;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;border:0px" allowfullscreen="true" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media *; picture-in-picture *;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-presentation"></iframe></div></div><h2><strong>About the Team</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><em>The Implementation team onboards our Premium, Pro and Enterprise customers onto the Perk platform, guiding them from signup to launch. We provide consultative, administrative, technical and educational support, and recommend ways to optimise each client's experience.</em></p><h2><br /><strong>About the Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">The Senior Implementation Specialist is a change management and consultative expert who owns the onboarding and successful adoption of our Enterprise clients. You dig deep into client needs, define the best onboarding strategy, and lead change inside the customer's organisation. You bridge platform capabilities and client expectations, delivering a 7-star experience from first contact through long-term success.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You ensure new clients are fully prepared to book business travel on Perk: configuring accounts to their requirements, supporting integrations and troubleshooting, and getting users ready through tailored training. You are confident steering clients towards the recommendations that serve them best in the long term, even when these differ from their original request.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Technical expertise is central to the role. You are the in-depth expert on the Perk Travel platform and its configuration options, and you understand integrations and open APIs well enough to guide clients and their IT teams through marketplace partner and custom-built setups. You can troubleshoot issues, translate complex technical concepts for both technical and non-technical audiences, and recommend the most effective mix of automations, integrations and platform features for each client. You also learn new tools and concepts quickly as the product evolves.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You are also a mentor for the Implementation team and the wider Revenue organisation, trusted as a source of expertise both internally and externally.</p><h2><br /><br /><strong>Responsibilities</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be the first impression of Perk and the first point of contact for clients and escalations throughout implementation, always delivering 7-star service.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hold consultative conversations to gather client requirements, and answer them with experience and data-driven best-practice recommendations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the timeline, rollout plan and account while it is in implementation, preparing and executing onboarding plans with strong project management and directing work across the internal team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as the subject matter expert in change management and adoption, leading customers through introducing a new travel tool and policies, and providing guides, templates and recommendations to support long-term success.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as a technical solutions expert: identify the best solutions for each client's needs, prioritising automations, integrations and the full range of platform functionality.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Configure client accounts to their specifications and provide technical support and troubleshooting, including setting up integrations with marketplace partners or custom-built API solutions.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan and deliver tailored training sessions for newly onboarded customers, including executive-level stakeholders and company-wide training.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead cross-functional projects, keeping all internal stakeholders aligned on the goal of full customer ramp-up. Collaborate with Sales, Account Management, Product, Engineering and Finance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Prioritise accounts based on client and business needs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Simplify complex technical information for all audiences.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Support Pre-Sales by explaining what an implementation will look like and how the platform can meet prospects' needs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Validate configuration and account satisfaction by monitoring client booking behaviour after launch, and proactively offering support or recommendations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Review completed implementations to improve your own process and the team's, following a cycle of execute, assess, improve, repeat.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Mentor colleagues and set an example for the Implementation team and the wider Revenue organisation.</p></li></ul><h2><br /><strong>What we look for</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A customer-first mindset, focused on a smooth onboarding and on what clients need to be happy in the long term.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A proven track record as a high achiever in an Implementation Specialist role, with previous experience working with Enterprise clients.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Success managing and delivering complex, international projects in a fast-paced environment, including defining scope and handling changing requirements while keeping the project on course.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated ability to work with C-level stakeholders to clarify their requirements and concerns clearly and professionally.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Superb communication skills, and the ability to build relationships at all levels internally and externally, adapting your approach as needed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A thoughtful, consultative approach to making recommendations to clients and internal stakeholders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Organised, structured and analytical, with strong problem-solving skills, creativity in solutions and keen attention to detail.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Tech-savvy, with an understanding of basic technical concepts around integrations and open APIs, and the ability to learn and adapt quickly.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A solution-oriented, proactive mindset with a commitment to continuous improvement, spotting opportunities to improve things for clients and the team.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excitement for challenges and a personal drive to make a difference.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI at Perk</strong><br />AI is embedded in how we work across every function. The tools you'll use day-to-day are AI-enabled so you can move faster and spend more time on the work that matters. In practice, that means using AI to research and prioritise accounts, draft and refine outreach, handle customer interactions more effectively, synthesise information, and cut through shadow work - the invisible tasks that pull people away from the work only they can do - so you can focus on relationships and outcomes.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How We Work</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Perk, we take an IRL-first approach to work, where our team works together in-person 3 days a week. As such, this role requires you to be based within commuting distance of our hubs. We fundamentally believe in the value of meeting in real life to improve connectivity, productivity, creativity and ultimately making us a great place to work.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For certain roles, we can help with relocation from anywhere in the world, English is the official language at the office. Please submit your resume in English if you choose to apply. Do not forget to submit an updated portfolio and/or resume.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Perk is a global company with a diverse customer base, and we want to make sure the people behind our product reflect that. We’re an equal opportunity employer, which means you’re welcome at Perk regardless of how you look, where you’re from, or anything else that makes you, well, you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Protect Yourself from Recruitment Scams</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">All official communication from Perk will always come from email addresses ending in @<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://perk.com">perk.com</a> or @<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://externalperk.com">externalperk.com</a>, our verified social media channels, or recruiters listed on our official LinkedIn page. We will never ask you to pay for equipment, training, or fees, request sensitive personal information such as bank details early in the process, or communicate through unofficial apps like WhatsApp, Telegram, or Signal. If you receive a message claiming to be from Perk that seems suspicious, please do not respond. Forward it to <u>security [at] perk .com</u>, and we will confirm whether it is legitimate.<br /><br />#LI-Hybrid</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/perk/senior-implementation-specialist-dutch-speaking-amsterdam-188667","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1792690816},{"slug":"enterprise-account-management-benelux-amsterdam-371022","company_name":"Perk","title":"Enterprise Account Management - Benelux","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About Us</strong><br /><br />Perk (formerly TravelPerk) is the intelligent platform for travel and spend management. Built to tackle the time-consuming, manual work that gets in the way of real work, our tools automate everything from travel bookings to expenses, invoice processing, and more. By eliminating this shadow work that wastes hours, erodes morale, and saps innovation, we're on a mission to power real work, with real impact.<br /><br />We're trusted by more than 12,000 companies worldwide, including Bolt, GoCardless, and Fabletics, and we're tackling the 7 hours of lost productivity per employee each week, <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.perk.com/shadow-work-report">a $1.7 trillion problem</a>.<br /><br />Founded in 2015, Perk has grown into a global company of more than 1,800 people across 12 offices globally, with headquarters in London and Boston. We combine innovation, control, and simplicity to transform how businesses work and how people feel at work.<br /><br />At Perk, we're driven by our values, like being an owner, delivering a 7-star experience, and working as one team. We value curiosity, purpose, and mindset, not just knowledge, to unlock the power in your potential. Our talent team brings together leading minds from the travel, fintech, and SaaS industries, representing over 70 countries. If you're excited about having a real impact and shaping how millions of people experience work, we'd love you on the team.<br /><br />Visit <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://www.perk.com">www.perk.com</a> to learn more.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><div><div style="left:0px;width:100%;height:0px;position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%"><iframe src="https://embedded-media.ashbyhq.com/embed/4899a966-8724-4480-958f-7271e5dc2807/f3e1915d-e346-4987-a1fb-9c447e8786c0" style="top:0px;left:0px;width:100%;height:100%;position:absolute;border:0px" allowfullscreen="true" scrolling="no" allow="encrypted-media *; picture-in-picture *;" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-presentation"></iframe></div></div><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>The Role</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for an experienced Dutch-speaking, customer-oriented and results-driven candidate to join our Benelux &amp; Nordics Account Management team.<strong> </strong>As an <strong>Enterprise Account Manager </strong>at Perk, you will be actively contributing to our continued customer satisfaction as well as working to increase growth and margin within existing accounts. In this role you will be responsible for a portfolio of top accounts. You must possess a genuine hunger to navigate your accounts in a fast-changing, hyper-growth environment, be ready to roll-up your sleeves and work hard.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What you’ll do</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own a portfolio of Tier 1 Customers and develop a high level of customer engagement with your contact and key decision makers within your accounts</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Gain a deep understanding of your customers business and be able to leverage this information to ensure that the customer maximises their usage of Perk</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify growth opportunities and develop your portfolio by adding new business opportunities</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Leverage data analytics to provide clients with regular business reviews, reports and presentations to senior stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Be an expert on the portfolio of Perk products in order to meet &amp; exceed quarterly targets of Up / Cross-selling</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Develop strong relationships with your clients that will shape their business travel programmes</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Identify common problems within each account and develop strategies to solve issues in a timely manner whilst creating methods to ensure long term solutions</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Act as a key contact between the internal Perk teams and the Account Management Team, to ensure product integrations during roll-outs are as smooth as possible.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Effectively prioritise your time in order to maximise impact in key business areas</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>What we’re looking for</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Native <strong>Dutch</strong> and professional proficiency in English</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience managing top tier accounts</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Outstanding presentation &amp; communication skills and the ability to build deep relationships</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Great prioritisation and time management skills</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Result oriented mindset while keeping customer satisfaction as your top priority</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Great ability to analyse and translate data for your customers</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>On top of that, you will be the right candidate if you are</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Empathetic: someone who can identify with the customer and genuinely wants to support them using an optimal problem-solving methodology</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Honest, open and trustworthy: your peers and managers can trust you. You are a team player, don’t play political games, and care more about the team’s success than about your own career gains</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Focused and determined: You don’t let yourself be distracted. You can focus on accomplishing big wins and never get lost in less important ideas that are floating around</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">You seek feedback early and often and are open to both give and take constructive and direct criticism</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What we offer</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">25 days of annual leave to rest and recharge, plus all public holidays.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>An optional pension scheme to support your long-term financial wellbeing.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>A tax-efficient bike leasing scheme through Lease a Bike, for your commute or personal use.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Reimbursed commuting costs if you live more than 10km away from the office.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive compensation paired with equity in Perk.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Unforgettable team experiences, including our annual summer party.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comprehensive wellbeing support through Spring Health, offering fast access to 12 therapy and 12 coaching sessions for you and your loved ones.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Focus on your family with 12-16 weeks’ paid parental leave</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">16 paid volunteer hours each year to give back to causes you care about.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Up to 20 “Work From Anywhere” days annually to explore the world while staying connected.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A fully paid four-week sabbatical after five years with Perk.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Relocation support to help you move seamlessly into one of our hubs.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>Interview Process</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Talent Acquisition Interview - 30mins Virtual</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assessment Interview - 60mins - In-person interview</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Values interview - 30mins virtual</p></li></ul><h2></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI at Perk</strong><br />AI is embedded in how we work across every function. The tools you'll use day-to-day are AI-enabled so you can move faster and spend more time on the work that matters. In practice, that means using AI to research and prioritise accounts, draft and refine outreach, handle customer interactions more effectively, synthesise information, and cut through shadow work - the invisible tasks that pull people away from the work only they can do - so you can focus on relationships and outcomes.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>How We Work</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At Perk, we take an IRL-first approach to work, where our team works together in-person 3 days a week. As such, this role requires you to be based within commuting distance of our hubs. We fundamentally believe in the value of meeting in real life to improve connectivity, productivity, creativity and ultimately making us a great place to work.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">For certain roles, we can help with relocation from anywhere in the world, English is the official language at the office. Please submit your resume in English if you choose to apply. Do not forget to submit an updated portfolio and/or resume.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Perk is a global company with a diverse customer base, and we want to make sure the people behind our product reflect that. We’re an equal opportunity employer, which means you’re welcome at Perk regardless of how you look, where you’re from, or anything else that makes you, well, you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Protect Yourself from Recruitment Scams</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">All official communication from Perk will always come from email addresses ending in @<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://perk.com">perk.com</a> or @<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="http://externalperk.com">externalperk.com</a>, our verified social media channels, or recruiters listed on our official LinkedIn page. We will never ask you to pay for equipment, training, or fees, request sensitive personal information such as bank details early in the process, or communicate through unofficial apps like WhatsApp, Telegram, or Signal. If you receive a message claiming to be from Perk that seems suspicious, please do not respond. Forward it to <u>security [at] perk .com</u>, and we will confirm whether it is legitimate.<br /><br />#LI-Hybrid</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/perk/enterprise-account-management-benelux-amsterdam-371022","tags":["Sales"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1792690816},{"slug":"senior-optimization-programmer-utrecht-46287","company_name":"sonyinteractiveentertainmentglobal","title":"Senior Optimization Programmer      ","description":"&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nixxes Software is an industry-leading Dutch company specializing in video game design, development and porting.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Working alongside global partners since 1999, our work is fueled by a love for gaming and commitment to innovation. Our Utrecht based team prides itself on delivering the best possible experience for every gamer, regardless of platform. In July 2021 Nixxes joined PlayStation Studios to focus on delivering the highest-quality gameplay experiences for PlayStation fans.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a highly collaborative, passionate, and skilled Senior Optimization Programmer that can support our teams for upcoming AAA titles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential Duties&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own optimization challenges on the project both on CPU and GPU.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize optimization challenges with leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the developers on the team with optimization challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Competencies, Skills &amp;amp; Knowledge&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent&amp;nbsp;understanding of optimization techniques on both CPU and GPU.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent debugging and profiling skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of code performance and complexity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work in an environment with deadlines and milestones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to write well-structured,&amp;nbsp;readable&amp;nbsp;and maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in C/C++ and other applicable programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Function well working in a team and on a large code base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates with directness/candor&amp;nbsp;and is adept at conflict resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in written and spoken English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Essential Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5(+) years programming experience in the game industry or a related industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plusses:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;(Native) Dutch speaker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to date knowledge of the current graphics APIs such as DirectX 12.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with console programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
