&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/creativefabrica/senior-backend-engineer-go-amsterdam-254941","tags":["Development"],"job_types":[],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1792670126},{"slug":"it-servicedesk-engineer-senior-rotterdam-425920","company_name":"Sunweb Group","title":"IT Servicedesk Engineer (Senior)","description":"<p><strong>Make technology work for everyone</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#121317">At Sunweb Group, technology plays a key role in delivering unforgettable holiday experiences to more than 1.3 million customers every year. Behind the scenes, our colleagues rely on secure, reliable, and user-friendly IT solutions to do their best work.&nbsp;<br>As an IT Servicedesk Engineer (Senior), you are the first point of contact for employees across our international organization. From resolving technical issues and supporting new joiners to improving processes and maintaining our digital workplace, you make sure colleagues can work efficiently and without disruption.</span><span style="color:#000000">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="color:#121317">You'll join our IT team in Rotterdam and collaborate closely with infrastructure, security, and development specialists to provide an excellent employee experience.</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Location:</strong> Rotterdam<br><strong>Start Date:</strong> ASAP<br><strong>Availability:</strong> Full-time<br></p><p><strong>Your impact</strong></p><p>In this role, you'll support colleagues across our international organisation, different hub offices and business functions. You'll combine hands-on IT support with ownership and continuous improvement, acting as a trusted point of contact for both colleagues and stakeholders.</p><p>Depending on your experience, you'll also take the lead in specific areas of expertise, support less experienced colleagues and contribute to improving and automating our IT processes.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Responsibilities</strong></p><ul><li><p>Resolve first- and second-line IT incidents and service requests through Jira, phone, email and walk-ins.</p></li><li><p>Troubleshoot hardware, software, network, VPN, Microsoft 365 and workplace-related issues.</p></li><li><p>Support onboarding and offboarding, including account creation, permissions, access and device setup.</p></li><li><p>Make sure new colleagues have the right tools and systems available from day one.</p></li><li><p>Manage and maintain user accounts, devices and workplace applications.</p></li><li><p>Act as an escalation point for more complex incidents and service requests.</p></li><li><p>Work closely with Infrastructure, Security and Development teams to resolve technical issues.</p></li><li><p>Contribute to ITIL-based service management processes and maintain clear knowledge documentation.</p></li><li><p>Identify recurring issues and turn them into opportunities for process improvements and automation.</p></li><li><p>Take ownership of specific areas of expertise, such as Microsoft 365 or IT service management.</p></li><li><p>Share knowledge, coach colleagues and contribute to the development of the wider IT support team.</p></li><li><p>Proactively engage with stakeholders to understand their needs and continuously improve the employee IT experience.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW196155263 BCX8"><strong><span style="color:#121317">What you'll bring</span><span style="color:#365F91">&nbsp;</span></strong></p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW196155263 BCX8"><li><p>At least 4 years of experience in IT support, service desk, workplace support or a similar role.</p></li><li><p>Strong knowledge of Microsoft 365, Azure and modern workplace environments.</p></li><li><p>Experience supporting Windows 11, macOS and mobile devices such as iPhones and iPads.</p></li><li><p>Experience with service management tools, preferably Jira Service Management.</p></li><li><p>A good understanding of ITIL principles and service desk best practices.</p></li><li><p>Strong troubleshooting skills and the ability to prioritise effectively.</p></li><li><p>The confidence to work independently, take ownership and act as an escalation point for colleagues.</p></li><li><p>Experience supporting, coaching or mentoring less experienced team members.</p></li><li><p>The ability to explain technical topics clearly to non-technical colleagues.</p></li><li><p>A proactive, service-minded approach and a strong sense of ownership.</p></li><li><p>Fluency in English. Dutch is a plus, but not required.</p></li><li><p>Microsoft, Azure and/or Workplace Management certifications are a strong advantage.</p></li><li><p>You are based in the Netherlands and able to work regularly from our Rotterdam office.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>About Sunweb Group</strong></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Sunweb Group is one of Europe’s largest online travel agencies, sending over 1.3 million holidaymakers annually to unforgettable destinations. Operating in eight international markets, we cater to all travelers through our brands, Sunweb and ‘Eliza Was Here.’ With a team of 600 colleagues and operational hubs in Rotterdam, Girona, Paris, Copenhagen, Stockholm, Antwerp, Chambéry, and Zurich, we deliver seamless, high-quality holiday experiences at competitive prices. Our Fast Forward culture fosters focus and trust, enabling us to shape the future of holidays while helping our customers press pause and create lasting memories.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why join our journey? </span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Monthly gross salary between €3,700 and €4300 plus 6 ATV days (based on full-time employment, excluding 8% holiday allowance)</span><em><span style="color:#121317">.</span></em></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Enjoy up to 20% off when booking with our brands for you, your family, and your friends.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">As an international company we support a hybrid way of working. We provide you with office furniture and IT equipment.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">We enjoy the journey so enjoy 25 holidays based on fulltime employment.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Access to a personalized Reflect &amp; Develop Plan to support your career growth.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Benefit from coaching sessions designed to support your well-being.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Receive work-from-home and travel allowances to ease your daily routine.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Ready for departure?</strong></p><p>Are you excited to help build and support the digital workplace behind Europe's leading travel company?</p><p>Click <strong>Apply</strong> and join us as our new <strong>IT Servicedesk </strong>Engineer. Do you have questions about the role? Feel free to contact our Talent Acquisition team via <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- We look forward to hearing from you!</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em>Sunweb Group is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive and safe environment where everyone can thrive.</em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><img style="width:523px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1u974n7ga2/Journey_No-assmnt_Step-1.png"></figure><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>#LI-Hybrid<br>#LI-YV1</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/sunweb-group/it-servicedesk-engineer-senior-rotterdam-425920","tags":["Tech"],"job_types":["Mid","fulltime fixed term"],"location":"Rotterdam, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792669911},{"slug":"stage-copy-content-marketing-rotterdam-232932","company_name":"Sunweb Group","title":"Stage Copy & Content Marketing","description":"<p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Heb jij een passie voor copy én vakantie? Wij ook! Ter versterking van ons Content Team zijn we per <strong>1 Februari 2027  </strong>op zoek naar een stagiair(e) Copy &amp; Content Marketing (meewerkstage). Tijdens deze stage loop je mee op de afdeling Copy &amp; Content Marketing. Jij helpt mee online content te creëren voor onze merken Sunweb en Eliza was Here. Zo leer je en draag je bij aan merkreputatie, klantenbinding, aansprekende copy voor verschillende communicatiekanalen en de verkoop van vakanties.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Startdatum:  Februari </p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8"><strong>Jouw impact</strong>&nbsp;<br>Bij jou begint de vakantiebeleving van onze klanten! Wij begeleiden je bij het schrijven van pakkende teksten voor onze kanalen (o.a. paid social, nieuwsbrieven) en je werkt en leert in een internationaal contentteam van 15 collega’s uit heel Europa. &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Als stagiair(e) Copy &amp; Content Marketing ondersteun je het team en ga jij o.a. aan de slag met:&nbsp;</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Schrijven en optimaliseren van copy voor interne afdelingen en diverse vraagstukken, zoals:&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Promotiemateriaal op vakantiebestemmingen&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Paid social posts voor campagnes&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">SEA-copy die scoort in zoekmachines&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Doorvertalen van marketingcampagnes naar verschillende kanalen.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Creëren van pakkende copy voor nieuwsbrieven en geautomatiseerde mailcampagnes.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8"><strong>Waarom stage lopen bij Sunweb Group?</strong>&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">✔️<strong> Maandelijkse stagevergoeding van € 500,- </strong>(op basis van fulltime stage)&nbsp;<br>✔️ <strong>Jong, ambitieus en supergezellig team</strong> waar je volop kunt groeien en leren&nbsp;<br>✔️ <strong>Hybride werken: </strong>50% thuis en 50% op kantoor – maar je bent altijd welkom voor extra kantoordagen<br>&nbsp;<br><strong>Wat maakt jou succesvol?</strong>&nbsp;</p><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Je schrijft foutloos Nederlands en hebt een goed taalgevoel&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Je beheerst de Engelse taal goed (voor interne samenwerking)&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Je bent proactief, enthousiast en hebt oog voor detail&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Je volgt een hbo-opleiding in de richting van communicatie of vergelijkbaar&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW220739736 BCX8"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Je bent per <strong>1 Februari 2027 </strong>beschikbaar voor <strong>32-40 uur</strong> per week, minimaal 5 maanden&nbsp;</p></li></ul><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8"><strong>Even voorstellen: Sunweb Group</strong> &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Sunweb Group is een van Europa’s grootste online reisorganisaties, die jaarlijks meer dan 1,3 miljoen vakantiegangers naar onvergetelijke bestemmingen brengt. We zijn actief in acht internationale markten en bedienen reizigers via onze bekende merken Sunweb en Eliza Was Here.  &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Met een team van meer dan 600 collega’s en operationele hubs in Rotterdam, Girona, Parijs, Kopenhagen, Stockholm, Antwerpen, Chambéry en Zürich, bieden we hoogwaardige, naadloze vakantie-ervaringen tegen concurrerende prijzen.  &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">Onze Fast Forward-cultuur stimuleert focus en vertrouwen, waardoor we de toekomst van vakanties vormgeven. Bij Sunweb Group draait alles om het creëren van zorgeloze reiservaringen en het helpen van onze klanten om écht even op pauze te drukken. &nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">&nbsp;<br><strong>Is dit jouw volgende uitdaging?</strong>&nbsp;✈️<br>Wil jij deel uitmaken van ons Content team? Klik op 'Apply' en stuur ons je CV met motivatiebrief. Heb je nog vragen? Neem gerust contact op met onze Talent Acquisition Team (<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- We kijken ernaar uit van je te horen! &nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br><em>Sunweb Group is een werkgever die gelijke kansen biedt, wat betekent dat we op geen enkele manier discrimineren. We vieren diversiteit en zetten ons in voor het creëren van een inclusieve en veilige omgeving voor alle medewerkers.</em>&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p class="Paragraph SCXW220739736 BCX8">#LI-Hybrid&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317"><span style="background-color:#FFFFFF">#LI-YV1</span></span></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/sunweb-group/stage-copy-content-marketing-rotterdam-232932","tags":["Internships"],"job_types":["Student college","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Rotterdam, Zuid-Holland, Netherlands","created_at":1792669911},{"slug":"senior-software-engineer-team-contract-rotterdam-357415","company_name":"Sunweb Group","title":"Senior Software Engineer (Team Contract)","description":"<h2>Build the technology behind our holiday contracts</h2><p class="___1et8vw6 f18zxyen f1mevb6" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>At Sunweb Group, we are developing a new internal application for creating and managing contracts with our suppliers and contractors.</p><p>As our Senior Software Engineer, you will help build this application from the ground up and replace an existing legacy solution with a modern, future-ready platform. You will have the opportunity to shape both the technical foundation and the way the new team works.</p><p>This is a new team with an initial size of approximately two to three engineers.</p><p>You will first be onboarded within Team Dalyan, working in a group of around five colleagues. Once the new Contracting Team is established, it will separate into its own team with a dedicated scope and responsibilities.</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Location:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Rotterdam Sunweb Group office (Hybrid)</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Start date:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;December 2026</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Availability</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: Fulltime</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">What you’ll do</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Design and build a new application for creating and maintaining supplier contracts.</p></li><li><p>Develop cloud-native solutions using C#, .NET and Microsoft Azure.</p></li><li><p>Build user-friendly React applications for internal users.</p></li><li><p>Help replace a legacy application with a scalable and maintainable modern solution.</p></li><li><p>Contribute to system design, architecture and data-modelling decisions.</p></li><li><p>Develop reliable integrations and work with SQL-based data.</p></li><li><p>Apply automated testing, CI/CD and DevOps practices throughout the development lifecycle.</p></li><li><p>Communicate technical decisions, progress, risks and dependencies clearly.</p></li><li><p>Take ownership from initial design through delivery and production.</p></li><li><p>Collaborate with contractors, suppliers and internal teams that depend on accurate contracting information.</p></li><li><p>Use GitHub Copilot and other supporting tools to improve productivity and software quality.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Our tech stack</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">C# · .NET · Microsoft Azure · SQL · React · GitHub · GitHub Copilot · CI/CD · Automated Testing · DevOps</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">What you bring</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>At least five years of professional experience with C# and .NET.</p></li><li><p>Experience building cloud-native applications on Microsoft Azure.</p></li><li><p>Strong SQL and data-modelling skills.</p></li><li><p>Solid system-design experience.</p></li><li><p>The ability to apply clean-architecture principles pragmatically.</p></li><li><p>Experience developing React applications, preferably for internal tools.</p></li><li><p>Experience with CI/CD, automated testing and DevOps practices.</p></li><li><p>Experience modernising or replacing legacy systems.</p></li><li><p>Clear communication skills and the ability to make progress, risks and dependencies visible.</p></li><li><p>An ownership mindset: you follow work through from idea to delivery.</p></li><li><p>A pragmatic approach that balances engineering quality with delivery needs.</p></li><li><p>Strong stakeholder communication skills in English (Dutch is a big plus).</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal" style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">What we offer</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Yearly gross salary between 65K and 80K, excluding 8% holiday allowance).</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">25 holidays + 6 ATV days, based on fulltime employment.&nbsp;</span><em><span style="color:#121317">Please note: ATV days do not apply to part-time contracts.</span></em></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Enjoy up to 20% off when booking with our brands for you, your family, and your friends.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">As an international company we support a hybrid way of working. We provide you with office furniture and IT equipment.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">A personalized Reflect &amp; Develop Plan to support your career growth.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Benefit from coaching sessions designed to support your well-being.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Receive work-from-home and travel allowances to ease your daily routine.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">About Sunweb Group</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="color:#121317">Sunweb Group is one of Europe’s largest online travel platforms, with over 1.3 million customers annually. We operate in 8 international markets with 500+ colleagues across </span>Europe. We<span style="color:#121317"> combine scale with a fast-moving, ownership-driven culture where teams are trusted to build and improve continuously.</span></p><p style="text-align:start;min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why this role is interesting</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Build a new application instead of only maintaining an existing system.</p></li><li><p>Influence technical decisions and architecture from an early stage.</p></li><li><p>Help shape a new engineering team and its ways of working.</p></li><li><p>Modernise a business-critical part of the Sunweb ecosystem.</p></li><li><p>Work with a modern Microsoft-based technology stack.</p></li><li><p>Take genuine ownership of a product with clear internal impact.</p></li><li><p>Join an international organisation that combines technology with unforgettable holiday experiences.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Ready for departure?&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#424242">Do you want to help build the future of contract management at Sunweb Group? Apply and tell us how you would approach creating a modern application that people can rely on.</span><span style="color:#121317"> </span></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Do you have any questions? Please feel free to reach out to our Talent Acquisition team via </span><a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- style="color:#121317">. We are looking forward to hearing from you!</span></p><p>Application deadline: 23 October</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><figure><img style="width:523px" src="https://recruitee-main.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/uploads/1u974n7ga2/Journey_No-assmnt_Step-1.png"></figure><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em><span style="