hat the work stays aligned with product goals. You'll be part of a group of <strong>six Engineering Leads</strong>, working together on team effectiveness, technical improvements and tech alignment across teams.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Location:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Sunweb Group office in Rotterdam (Hybrid) <br></span><strong><span style="color:#121317">Start Date:</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">&nbsp;Asap</span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Availability</span></strong><span style="color:#121317">: Fulltime<br></span></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Your impact</span></strong></p><ul class="___yduxjt0 fjh19gf f18zxyen f1mevb6 f1mswpri"><li><p>Lead, coach and develop three engineering teams, and build high-performing teams with a growth and blameless mindset</p></li><li><p>Ensure predictable delivery while balancing speed with sustainable engineering practices</p></li><li><p>Drive technical improvements and engineering excellence, and promote software best practices</p></li><li><p>Simplify complex technical solutions and help teams make sound technical decisions</p></li><li><p>Guide teams through change and build a culture of continuous improvement</p></li><li><p>Align multiple stakeholders across business and technology, and drive tech alignment on cross-team initiatives</p></li><li><p>Work with external technology partners and suppliers when needed</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong>Who you'll work with</strong></p><p class="___1et8vw6 f18zxyen f1mevb6">You'll work closely with other Engineering Leads, Software Engineers, Architects and Product Owners. You'll also work with technicall stakeholders from Hotels, Transport, Ancillaries and Purchasing.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><h4 class="___zyebl90 f1pp30po fl43uef f106mvju fqcjy3b f1mevb6"><strong>Who you are</strong></h4><p class="___1et8vw6 f18zxyen f1mevb6">You're a servant leader with strong people skills, technical curiosity and high quality standards, and you take a pragmatic approach. You work independently, take ownership and stay resilient when you meet resistance. You hold teams accountable, balance business and technical needs, and are always looking for the next step to improve.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">What you bring</span></strong></p><ul class="___yduxjt0 fjh19gf f18zxyen f1mevb6 f1mswpri"><li><p>5+ years of experience in software engineering</p></li><li><p>A Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, IT or a related field, or equivalent practical experience</p></li><li><p><strong>Fluency in English</strong></p></li><li><p>Dutch and/or Spanish is a big plus</p></li><li><p>Proven experience leading engineering teams, and you're comfortable managing several teams at once</p></li><li><p>Experience working with cross-functional product teams and with Product and Architecture stakeholders</p></li><li><p>Strong skills in people leadership, coaching, stakeholder management and Agile delivery</p></li><li><p>Strong communication and influencing skills, plus experience with change management</p></li><li><p>A lean approach to problem solving and decision making</p></li><li><p>Solid technical knowledge of:</p><ul class="___yduxjt0 fjh19gf f18zxyen f1mevb6 f1mswpri"><li><p>Software engineering and modern cloud-native architectures</p></li><li><p>CI/CD, DevOps and software delivery practices</p></li><li><p>Software quality, observability, security and operational excellence</p></li><li><p>AI-assisted development tools that improve engineering productivity</p></li><li><p>Lean software craftsmanship and continuous improvement</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p><strong>Your toolbox</strong></p><p class="___1et8vw6 f18zxyen f1mevb6">Microsoft 365, Azure DevOps, Jira, GitHub, CI/CD tooling, observability and monitoring platforms, and collaboration and documentation tools.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><em><span style="color:#121317">Not ticking every box? At Sunweb Group, we believe curiosity, energy, and the right mindset matter more than meeting every single requirement. If this role excites you, we’d love to hear your story — let’s explore the journey together.</span></em></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="text-align:start;"><strong><span style="color:#121317">Let us introduce Sunweb Group&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p style="text-align:start;"><span style="color:#121317">Sunweb Group is one of Europe’s largest online travel agencies, sending over 1.3 million holidaymakers annually to unforgettable destinations. Operating in eight international markets, we cater to all travelers through our brands, Sunweb and ‘Eliza Was Here.’ With a team of 600 colleagues and operational hubs in Rotterdam, Girona, Paris, Copenhagen, Stockholm, Antwerp, Chambéry, and Zurich, we deliver seamless, high-quality holiday experiences at competitive prices. Our Fast Forward culture fosters focus and trust, enabling us to shape the future of holidays while helping our customers press pause and create lasting memories.&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="color:#121317">Why join our journey? </span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Yearly gross salary between 77K and 95K plus 6 ATV days (based on full-time employment, excluding 8% holiday allowance). </span><em><span style="color:#121317">Please note: ATV days do not apply to part-time contracts.</span></em></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">Enjoy up to 20% off when booking with our brands for you, your family, and your friends.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#121317">As an international company we support a hybrid way of working. We provide you with office furniture and IT equipment.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li><p