rom diverse CNC controllers (e.g., Heidenhain, Fanuc, Siemens) using industrial protocols (OPC UA, MTConnect, FOCAS, etc.).</p></li><li><p><strong>Core Programming:</strong> Strong coding experience in Python, C++, C#, <a rel="noopener" target="_blank" href="http://Node.js">Node.js</a>, or similar languages to build scalable integrations, edge agents, and rapid prototypes.</p></li><li><p><strong>Edge Deployment:</strong> Solid experience using Docker to containerize applications and reliably deploy them to industrial edge devices or gateways.</p></li><li><p><strong>Ecosystem Integration:</strong> Experience connecting custom software with 3rd-party services for manufacturing, such as ERP systems, cutting tool databases, or external APIs.</p></li></ol><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/imnoo-ag/remote-ai-cad-cam-iot-engineer-tinkerer-cnc-junior-mid-senior-berlin-204969","tags":["Software Department","Remote"],"job_types":["Entry","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Remote job","created_at":1792669914},{"slug":"machine-learning-computer-graphics-engineer-remote-part-full-time-junior-mid-senior-berlin-96875","company_name":"Imnoo AG","title":"Machine Learning / Computer Graphics Engineer (remote part/full time) - Junior/Mid/Senior","description":"<p><strong>Geometry with consequences.</strong> Deep learning on 3D CAD data where correctness translates into steel and aluminum, not pixels.</p><p><strong>The ultimate tinkerer's playground.</strong> Physical machines, shop floors, and modern cloud architectures all in one stack.</p><p><strong>Tangible impact.</strong> Your work feeds the data pipelines that power our AI quoting and calculation engines. Factories operate differently because of what you ship.</p><p><strong>High autonomy.</strong> A fragmented industry full of unsolved problems, and the freedom to prototype, test, and deploy your own solutions end-to-end.