ipelines and automation solutions, ideally with CircleCI.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW203643763 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW203643763 BCX0">Solid scripting or software development skills in Bash, TypeScript or Python.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW203643763 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW203643763 BCX0">Practical experience using AI-assisted and agentic engineering tools in DevOps workflows, combined with the curiosity and ability to evaluate emerging AI capabilities.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW203643763 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW203643763 BCX0">Experience with containerized environments using Docker and Amazon ECS.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW203643763 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW203643763 BCX0">Strong understanding of monitoring, logging, alerting, and observability concepts (e.g. CloudWatch, Instana), including troubleshooting across applications and infrastructure.</p></li></ul><ul class="BulletListStyle1 SCXW203643763 BCX0"><li><p class="Paragraph SCXW203643763 BCX0">Knowledge of cloud security best practices, AWS governance, FinOps, and experience working with externally hosted environments, complemented by practical experience leveraging AI-assisted engineering tools.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><strong><span style="font-size:1.3em">What we offer you</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><strong>Hybrid work:<em>&nbsp;</em></strong>Combine flexible remote work with team time in the Cologne office (on-site days depending on your location)</p></li><li><p><strong>Workation:</strong><em> </em>Temporarily work from a destination of your choice within EU, Iceland, Liechtenstein or Norway</p></li><li><p><strong>28</strong> vacation days </p></li><li><p><strong>2.5</strong> additional days off at Christmas, New Year's Eve and Carnival</p></li><li><p>Buddy program (an experienced trustee is at your side)</p></li><li><p>Individual learning &amp; development opportunit