 und persönlich zu wachsen.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Spannendes Aufgabenfeld:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Bei uns arbeitest du mit neuen Technologien und Tools und gestaltest aktiv mit, wie wir als Agentur effizienter und erfolgreicher werden.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">100 % Remote:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Du wählst deinen Arbeitsort frei und arbeitest dort, wo du am konzentriertesten und produktivsten bist.</span></p></li><li><p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Flexible Arbeitszeiten:</span></strong><span style="color:#000000"> Du teilst dir deine Stunden rund um Vorlesungen und Prüfungen selbst ein und arbeitest dann, wenn du am leistungsfähigsten bist.</span></p></li></ul> <br> <p><strong><span style="color:#000000">Stellenanforderungen:</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Eingeschriebene/r Student/-in der Wirtschaftsinformatik, Informatik oder BWL mit IT-Bezug</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Abgeschlossenes Grundstudium (mindestens 4 Semester)</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Die Fähigkeit, bestehenden Prozessen zu folgen</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Schnelle Auffassungsgabe und hohe Disziplin</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Guter Umgang mit Leistungsdruck</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Ausgeprägte Teamfähigkeit</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Saubere und fehlerfreie schriftliche Ausdrucksform in Deutsch</span></p></li><li><p><span style="color:#000000">Vorkenntnisse in den Themen Online-Marketing, Coaching, Beratung etc. sind von Vorteil, aber nicht notwendig.</span></p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p><span style="color:#000000">Wenn die Stellenbeschreibung dein Interesse geweckt hat, klicke einfach auf den Bewerben-Button, fülle das Formular aus, und schicke deine Bewerbung ab. Wir freuen uns, dich kennenzulernen!</span></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":true,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/roman-mayer-gmbh/werkstudent-in-wirtschaftsinformatik-remote-frankfurt-am-main-246432","tags":["Business Development","Remote"],"job_types":["Entry","fulltime permanent"],"location":"Homeoffice","created_at":1792669904},{"slug":"senior-product-manager-reporting-berlin-140502","company_name":"bunch","title":"Senior Product Manager | Reporting (f/m/d)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.bunch.capital/"><u>bunch</u></a> is building the backbone of private markets. We are enabling next-gen fund operations with one integrated system that combines secure data infrastructure, AI-powered workflows and expert fund services. If you value ownership, growth through real responsibility, and working with a thoughtful, ambitious team, this role might be for you.</p><h1><strong>The Role</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a Senior Product Manager to join bunch’s Reporting team. You’ll own the products and workflows that turn fund and portfolio data into correct, trusted reporting that’s ready to send to investors.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You’ll work at the heart of how fund managers communicate performance and activity to their investors. That means building intuitive reporting experiences and report-generation capabilities customers can trust.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>As Senior Product Manager, Reporting Platform, you will:</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own key parts of our reporting product and its workflows end-to-end</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Make sure the numbers investors see are right, from the data fund managers enter, through the calculations, to the final reports and the LP portal</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive product decisions that balance accuracy, compliance and usability</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner closely with engineering, design and operations to deliver a system customers can rely on</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>This role focuses on the Reporting side of the platform. Typical areas include:</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Portfolio data capture: how fund managers record investments, valuations and portfolio events like follow-ons, conversions and exits, with a strong focus on intuitive UI/UX, data quality and completeness</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">The calculation layer between fund accounting and investor reporting: turning the fund’s books and portfolio valuations into correct investor numbers, with checks that tie them together</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Report generation workflows: quarterly and annual packages, capital account statements and PDFs ready to send to investors</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Configuration and customisation: templates, branding, disclosures, and language and currency formatting</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Data readiness and correctness for reports: validation, completeness checks and auditability</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Distribution and delivery: review and approval flows, delivery to investors, and access controls</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Observability for reporting runs: errors, retries, performance and transparency for customers</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Top Responsibilities</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive roadmap and execution for reporting workflows and the reporting experiences customers see</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Translate domain requirements into clear product specs (inputs → transformations → outputs) with strong edge-case handling</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with engineering to define the right building blocks for scalable report generation (templates, data contracts, versioning)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Collaborate with design to make complex reporting setup and review flows intuitive and fast</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with fund accounting, operations and customer-facing teams to identify friction, ensure correctness and improve time-to-report</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Define and track success metrics across adoption, report quality, operational efficiency and reliability</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain a high bar for data integrity, traceability and customer trust</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>About You</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">7+ years of product management experience building B2B fintech products</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong product execution skills: shipping, iteration loops, prioritization and stakeholder alignment</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A solid grasp of financial reporting basics: how they work and why every number has to trace back to a source. Experience from accounting, banking, payments, treasury or financial data products all counts</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to turn complex requirements into simple product surfaces and crisp product logic</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Analytical mindset: you can define metrics, investigate root causes and make data-informed tradeoffs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excellent communication: you write clear specs and collaborate well with technical and non-technical partners</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working closely with engineering on systems that need reliability, monitoring and rigor on edge cases</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Nice to have: exposure to fund or investment reporting (NAV, capital accounts, fees, IRR, TVPI, DPI). You don’t need a private markets background. We’ll teach you, and you’ll work every day with our fund accounting experts</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Workplace &amp; Benefits</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Competitive salary plus equity</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Customizable benefits package (wellbeing, sport, mobility, food and more)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">28 days of vacation, plus 2 company days and local public holidays</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hybrid setup with 2 days a week in the office</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Up to 4 remote calendar weeks a year</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A great tech and work setup</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work with a diverse team of 140+ bunchies from 40+ countries, with leaders who are best-in-class in their domains</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Hiring process</h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">First interview with the People team (20 min) to get to know bunch and explore whether what we’re offering matches what you’re looking for</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hiring manager interview with our VP of Product (45 min) to discuss your experience, your approach and your fit for the role</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Product case interview with our Product &amp; Design team (60 min) to show your product thinking, communication and execution style</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Stakeholder interviews (3 x 30 min) with members of Operations, Engineering and our Founders to align on vision and expectations</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1>Curious to learn more?</h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">Get a feel for who we are, how we work, and what we’re building:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.bunch.capital/about">About bunch</a> – Our mission, product, and journey so far</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.bunch.capital/case-studies">Case Studies</a> – About those who already build on bunch</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.bunch.capital/blog">Gathering insights</a> – Our latest bunch of blog posts</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>About bunch</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">bunch is building the operating infrastructure for the next generation of private markets. We combine AI-powered automation with deep regulatory expertise to replace fragmented spreadsheets and manual processes with one integrated platform across the fund lifecycle, purpose-built for private markets heading toward $32 trillion in Assets Under Management.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We've 4x our ARR in 2025, crossed 150 fund managers and 12,000 LPs on the platform, and just closed our $35M Series B in May 2026. We're looking for ambitious people who want real ownership of hard problems, and who care about building infrastructure that actually matters to the people using it.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><br />____<br /><br />At bunch, we're committed to an inclusive environment where diversity is valued and celebrated. We provide equal opportunities to all qualified applicants.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We process personal data in line with applicable laws (including GDPR). See our<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.bunch.capital/privacy-policy"> <u>Privacy Policy</u></a> for details on your rights and how to reach us.</p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/bunch/senior-product-manager-reporting-berlin-140502","tags":["Tech"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Berlin","created_at":1792669229},{"slug":"remote-b2b-marketing-singapore-ne-asia-124922","company_name":"ElevenLabs","title":"B2B Marketing - Singapore & NE Asia","description":"<h2>About ElevenLabs</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenLabs is an AI research and product company transforming how we interact with technology.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We launched in January 2023 with the first human-like AI voice model. Today, we serve millions of users and thousands of businesses - from fast-growing startups to large enterprises like Deutsche Telekom and Meta. Our investors are some of the world's most prominent, including Andreessen Horowitz, ICONIQ Growth and Sequoia. We've raised $781M in funding and our last valuation was $22B - multiples of 11, always.<br /><br />We have expanded from voice into three main platforms:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenAgents enables businesses to deliver seamless and intelligent customer experiences, with the integrations, testing, monitoring, and reliability necessary to deploy voice and chat agents at scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenCreative empowers creators and marketers to generate and edit speech, music, image, and video across 70+ languages.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">ElevenAPI gives developers access to our leading AI audio foundational models.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">Everything we do is the result of the creativity and commitment of our team - builders doing the best work of their lives. We are researchers, engineers, and operators. IOI medalists and ex-founders. If you want to work hard and create lasting positive impact, we want to hear from you.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>How we work</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>High-velocity: </strong>Rapid experimentation, lean autonomous teams, and minimal bureaucracy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Impact not job titles: </strong>We don’t have job titles. Instead, it’s about the impact you have. No task is above or beneath you.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>AI first:</strong> We use AI to move faster with higher-quality results. We do this across the whole company—from engineering to growth to operations.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Excellence everywhere: </strong>Everything we do should match the quality of our AI models.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Global team: </strong>We prioritize your talent, not your location.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2>What we offer</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Innovative culture:</strong> You’ll be part of a generational opportunity to define the trajectory of AI, surrounded by a team pushing the boundaries of what’s possible.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Growth paths: </strong>Joining ElevenLabs means joining a dynamic team with countless opportunities to drive impact - beyond your immediate role and responsibilities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Learning &amp; development</strong>: ElevenLabs proactively supports professional development through an annual discretionary stipend.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Social travel</strong>: We also provide an annual discretionary stipend to meet up with colleagues each year, however you choose.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Annual company offsite: </strong>Each year, we bring the entire team together in a new location - past offsites have included Croatia and Italy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Co-working</strong>: If you’re not located near one of our main hubs, we offer a monthly co-working stipend.</p></li></ul><h2>About the role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are looking for a powerhouse Growth Marketer to own and accelerate our B2B footprint in Singapore . This isn't a traditional marketing role; we need a "jack of all trades" who can pivot from high-level campaign planning to setting up complex outbound sequences in the same afternoon.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will be the primary driver for growth in Singapore, taking full ownership of projects from inception to the final outcome. You are someone who views "chaos" as an opportunity to build and thrives when managing multiple workstreams simultaneously.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Your Responsibilities</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Full-Funnel Ownership:</strong> Drive the Singapore B2B growth strategy and partially tackle the North Asia markets, owning the pipeline target from lead gen to conversion.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Outbound Mastery:</strong> Set up, manage, and optimize complex outbound sequences to reach enterprise decision-makers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Event &amp; Campaign Execution:</strong> Organize high-impact events, webinars, and trade shows from start to finish.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Performance &amp; Analysis:</strong> Work closely with the performance team on retargeting and ABM, while being comfortable diving deep into the numbers to analyze what’s working.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Creative Content:</strong> Craft compelling sales collateral, thought leadership content, and messaging tailored to the regional tech landscape.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Vendor &amp; Partner Management:</strong> Identify and orchestrate top-tier local partnerships and sponsorships.</p></li></ul><div style="min-height:1.2em;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"> </div><h2>Requirements</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>English and Mandarin Speaker.</strong></p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>The "Owner" Mentality:</strong> Proven track record