&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Elasticsearch develops and distributes technology and information that is subject to U.S. and other countries’ export controls and licensing requirements for individuals who are located in or are nationals of the following sanctioned countries and regions: Belarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, or Russia, including the Ukrainian territories annexed by Russia (The Crimea region of Ukraine, The Donetsk People&#39;s Republic (DNR), The Luhansk People&#39;s Republic (LNR), Kherson or Zaporizhzhia). If you are located in or are a national of one of the listed countries or regions, an export license may be required as a condition of your employment in this role. Please note that national origin and/or nationality do not affect eligibility for employment with Elastic.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please see&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.elastic.co/legal/applicant-privacy-statement&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1611068262479000&amp;amp;usg=AFQjCNG3orAPk5sJIr9WVm0ZDxYw82c5DA&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for our Privacy Statement.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/elastic/director-of-product-management-observability-117853","tags":["Obs - Application Observability"],"job_types":[],"location":"","created_at":1792691725},{"slug":"manager-ai-engineering-united-kingdom-107390","company_name":"SandboxAQ","title":"Manager, AI Engineering","description":"<h2><strong>About SandboxAQ</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">SandboxAQ is a high-growth company delivering AI solutions that address some of the world's greatest challenges. The company’s Large Quantitative Models (LQMs) power advances in life sciences, financial services, navigation, cybersecurity, and other sectors.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are a global team that is tech-focused and includes experts in AI, chemistry, cybersecurity, physics, mathematics, medicine, engineering, and other specialties. The company emerged from Alphabet Inc. as an independent, growth capital-backed company in 2022, funded by leading investors and supported by a braintrust of industry leaders.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">At SandboxAQ, we’ve cultivated an environment that encourages creativity, collaboration, and impact. By investing deeply in our people, we’re building a thriving, global workforce poised to tackle the world's epic challenges. Join us to advance your career in pursuit of an inspiring mission, in a community of like-minded people who value entrepreneurialism, ownership, and transformative impact.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>The Opportunity</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">The SandboxAQ AI team is looking for a hands-on Manager, AI Engineering to help us build the future of agentic collaboration, trust and ROI. Our goal is to make agents work well on their own, in teams, and with humans. This includes the following aspects:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Security</strong>: Discovery of agents, evaluation, red teaming, monitoring, guardrails, etc.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Quality</strong>: Measuring ROI of agents and suggesting improvements</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Collaboration</strong>: Bringing humans and agents together into one place with shared context</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">A successful candidate thrives at the intersection of AI and software engineering. You deeply understand how models and agents work, how they can fail, how they can be protected and improved. You have hands-on experience with agents in production, know what works and what doesn’t, know the latest trends and you’re opinionated about the future. You know what you don’t know and enjoy learning to close those gaps. You’ll turn your insights and innovation into real world features baked into our platform - shipping code to production.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a hands-on leadership role where you’ll break things, fix them and then harden them for good while also leading a small team of engineers. At the same time, you’ll have freedom to explore, collaborate, publish, and deploy, shaping the field of agentic collaboration and trust from all angles. You will help set technical direction, raise the quality bar, mentor team members, and ensure that the team moves quickly from research insight to real-world product impact.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for somebody with the curiosity of a researcher, the rigor of an engineer, and the creativity of a hacker. You will be part of a diverse team consisting of ML experts, security experts, mathematicians, and software engineers, each playing a key role in efficient and effective enablement of the cutting-edge technologies being developed at SandboxAQ.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Lead and grow a small, highly technical team while remaining deeply involved in hands-on engineering and research.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Set technical direction, break down ambiguous problems, establish practical plans for fast, high-quality execution, and build a culture of ownership, low-ego collaboration, thoughtful experimentation, and high standards.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Create new agentic capabilities, including frameworks for monitoring, guardrailing, and evaluating agents, while staying current on the latest agentic developments and identifying new opportunities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Perform classical ML tasks, including exploratory data analysis, feature engineering, and model fine-tuning, and rapidly iterate on prototypes and features based on feedback and evolving product needs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Work closely with Product and Research to translate AI research into applicable features and software engineering projects.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Contribute production-ready code and technical designs, working across engineering to deliver scalable, reliable software.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Essential Skills &amp; Experience</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">BSc in Computer Science or related field with exposure to AI/ML.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deep expertise in AI/ML, software engineering, or AI security.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong programming skills in Python, and relevant ML and/or agentic frameworks.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Demonstrated ability to work cross-functionally and collaboratively with a high degree of end-to-end ownership, delivering real world outcomes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to pick up other programming languages and technologies as required to ship scalable and reliable software.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Highly Desired Skills &amp; Experience</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">PhD in Computer Science or related field with focus on AI/ML or similar.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience with at least one of the following: agent orchestration, agent harnesses, agent teams, jailbreaking / prompt injection, red teaming, data poisoning or evasion attacks, secure model deployment or sandboxing, detection and monitoring for AI misuse.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience contributing to open source projects.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in a fast-paced startup environment.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience in cybersecurity is a plus, but not essential.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p></li></ul><h1><strong>Why Join Us?</strong></h1><p style="min-height:1.5em">We offer a comprehensive and competitive benefits package designed to support your health, financial well-being, and life outside of work.</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Career Defining Work</strong>: Your work will directly accelerate the discovery of better drugs and better materials, advance human health, and enable safer and more sustainable technologies by helping customers put AI Simulation capabilities into real world use.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Compensation: </s