&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of creators. We write code, shape delivery, build go-to-market strategies, develop AI solutions and create the practices that support our people. We work side by side with our clients, challenging what’s not working and helping them to build the future. Our commitment to craft, quality, and culture has helped us scale to over 600 people in just a few years.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;CreateFuture is a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.greatplacetowork.co.uk/certified-company/1572759&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Great Place to Work-Certified™ company &lt;/a&gt;and has won Best Workplaces UK multiple years in a row.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us on our journey. Let’s create tomorrow, together, today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_1bsb1osq _18s8y1gf _p12fukw8&quot; data-testid=&quot;view-page-labels-container&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About the role and team:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CreateFuture is looking for a collaborative, technically grounded Senior Business Analyst to join our team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Senior Business Analysts drive high-impact change across a broad spectrum of client engagements. While we deliver end-to-end digital products, this role is tailored for a BA who is as comfortable driving complex back-end environments (such as API integrations, platform migrations, data architecture, and system integration logic) as they are crafting front-end user experiences and feature specifications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll leverage your proficiency in business analysis, system architecture, and product strategy to guide project development, acting as the crucial bridge between technical and non-technical stakeholders. Your responsibilities span meticulous requirements analysis, data flow mapping, estimation, and championing delivery best practices within your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your exceptional communication skills are pivotal for translating complex client objectives into clear, developer-ready specifications and data flows, ensuring what we build is both valuable for users and technically robust under the hood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Does this sound like you? Do you have a passion for the craft of Business Analysis, a natural curiosity for how complex backend systems work, and an interest in how modern tools are changing how we work? If so, we’d love to talk to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate current and emerging business procedures, collaborating with clients and internal teams to propose impactful system solutions and process improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively bring cross-functional teams together to shape user stories, acceptance criteria, process flows, and technical specifications (including API contracts, payload logic, and data mappings).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate data analysis, query system data to uncover edge cases, and map complex integration dependencies across backend architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project backlogs during discovery, build, and run phases, balancing business priorities against technical constraints, non-functional requirements (NFRs), and engineering effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and lead client discovery conversations, driving estimation efforts, facilitating workshops, and championing best practices across your project team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;styles--2BkR3&quot; data-ui=&quot;job-description&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to talk to you if you have:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering both product-led user initiatives and complex technical projects (e.g., API integrations, platform migrations, data architecture).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working for a Consultancy or Client facing environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience as a Technical Business Analyst working closely with engineering, architecture and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with&amp;nbsp;data, including data mapping, data models, databases and ideally SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of working alongside engineering teams to analyse data flows, system logic, and technical dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A user-centric mindset that ensures backend architectural choices directly support a seamless end-user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to bridge the gap between technical and non-technical stakeholders, gaining a deep understanding of business context and translating complex goals into clear. specifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring meticulous requirements analysis, lead estimation efforts, and champion best practices across your project team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experimented with AI tools to accelerate research, draft baseline specifications, map data fields, or red-team edge cases in system flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to or curiosity about how modern AI capabilities, LLMs, or agentic workflows integrate into backend system architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive approach to exploring new tools and techniques that improve the speed and quality of business analysis, with a desire to share those learnings with colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;You don’t need to arrive as an AI expert. If you haven’t yet had much opportunity to put AI into practice in your BA work, that shouldn’t stop you from applying. What matters to us is curiosity, a willingness to experiment, and a commitment to high-quality analysis. Everyone at CreateFuture undertakes AI-native training, and we’ll support you to build these capabilities and put them into practice.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
