&lt;li&gt;Present complex ideas to senior client stakeholders, keep them engaged and handle difficult questions well&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape a compelling narrative for your workstream and hold every deliverable to a high standard&lt;/li&gt;
