ourcing and preparing materials for prototype testing, and report results to systems engineers.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build qualification frameworks and guidance for the wider team, and contribute to growing an internal materials team.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Candidate Requirements</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Master’s degree or PhD in Chemistry, Materials Science, Chemical Engineering or a related field.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong understanding of explosive materials, propellants and pyrotechnics, including explosive safety and hazardous materials handling.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands-on experience with analytical techniques such as DSC, TGA, FTIR and Raman spectroscopy.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience characterizing and evaluating materials in accordance with NATO qualification standards.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience running qualification programs for materials used in pyrotechnic or energetic systems.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Understanding of materials manufacturing processes and quality controls.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Fluency in English required.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We look forward to hearing how you can help shape the future of autonomous defense systems at Harmattan AI.</p><p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.ch/jobs/companies/harmattan-ai/energetic-materials-scientist-munitions-lausanne-465601","tags":["R&D"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Lausanne","created_at":1792593618},{"slug":"h3c-expert-fur-infrastruktur-migration-basel-429539","company_name":"Coopers Group AG","title":"H3C Expert für Infrastruktur Migration","description":"<p>................</p>Für ein anspruchsvolles Infras