<p><span data-ccp-props="{}"><span data-contrast="auto"><strong>What You Will Own</strong></span></span></p>
<p><span data-ccp-props="{}"><span data-contrast="auto">-The locale’s review service score, including RQE audit and alignment performance<br>-The community’s shared understanding of quality&nbsp;<br>-The integrity of the arbitration record, ensuring that every arbitration sent to the client is valid and well-evidenced<br>-The working relationship with the client’s Language Manager, including clarifications, escalations, and expectation tracking</span><br></span></p>
</div>
