on of mmWave converter functionality, development of calibration-related features, firmware verification, and enhancement of VNA measurement capabilities up to 170 GHz.</p><p class="MsoNormal">You are comfortable working with large existing software architectures and can effectively analyze, modify, and extend complex instrument software while maintaining product quality and performance.</p><p class="MsoNormal">This role is ideal for an experienced engineer who combines strong C++ development capabilities with practical understanding of RF measurements, calibration concepts, and automated verification methodologies.</p><p class="MsoNormal">You will also leverage AI-assisted development tools such as GitHub Copilot, Cursor AI, or similar technologies to improve development efficiency while maintaining full engineering ownership of the solution delivered.<br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">Your Responsibilities</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Take technical ownership of firmware and software subsystems within advanced Test &amp; Measurement products</p></li><li><p>Analyze and extend existing C++ software architectures and instrument software platforms</p></li><li><p>Develop and integrate new functionality for VNA and mmWave measurement systems</p></li><li><p>Implement calibration-related features and measurement workflows</p></li><li><p>Support integration of mmWave converters and high-frequency measurement capabilities</p></li><li><p>Design, implement, and maintain SCPI-controlled instrument functionality</p></li><li><p>Develop and execute automated verification and validation activities</p></li><li><p>Create and maintain Python-based test automation frameworks</p></li><li><p>Perform debugging, troubleshooting, root cause analysis, and performance optimization</p></li><li><p>Ensure software quality through unit, integration, and system testing</p></li><li><p>Collaborate with system architects, firmware engineers, hardware engineers, and customer-facing technical teams</p></li><li><p>Identify technical risks, dependencies, and integration challenges at an early stage</p></li><li><p>Contribute to technical documentation, knowledge sharing, and engineering best practices</p></li><li><p>Apply AI-assisted development tools responsibly to improve productivity, code quality, testing, and documentation</p></li></ul><p><strong><span style="color:#2f5496"><br>What You Bring<br></span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">Required Qualifications</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Software Engineering, Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, Physics, or a related technical field</p></li><li><p>Strong professional experience with modern C++ software development</p></li><li><p>Experience working with large-scale instrument software or firmware codebases</p></li><li><p>Experience with C++ templates, generic programming, and modern software design principles</p></li><li><p>Experience with Qt application development</p></li><li><p>Experience with firmware development, hardware communication, and device control</p></li><li><p>Advanced knowledge of multithreading and concurrent software architectures</p></li><li><p>Experience with Visual Studio and CMake-based development environments</p></li><li><p>Strong understanding of SCPI protocols and instrument control</p></li><li><p>Experience with Python-based automated testing and verification</p></li><li><p>Experience with unit, integration, and system-level testing</p></li><li><p>Experience using AI-assisted development tools such as GitHub Copilot, Cursor AI, or similar technologies</p></li><li><p>Strong debugging, troubleshooting, and analytical problem-solving skills</p></li><li><p>Ability to independently execute work packages and take technical ownership</p></li><li><p>Strong written and verbal communication skills in English</p></li><li><p>Experience collaborating within distributed or international engineering teams using Git<br></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">Preferred Qualifications</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Experience with Vector Network Analyzers (VNA)</p></li><li><p>RF measurement and calibration expertise</p></li><li><p>Knowledge of S-parameter measurements, leveling, and ALC concepts</p></li><li><p>Experience within the Test &amp; Measurement industry</p></li><li><p>Experience with mmWave converters and high-frequency measurement systems</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with Spectrum Analyzer or Signal Generator products</p></li><li><p>Experience with automated test frameworks such as PyTest</p></li><li><p>Experience working within remote or customer-hosted development environments</p></li><li><p>Experience interacting directly with technical customer stakeholders<br></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">Nice to Have</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Knowledge of high-frequency RF systems above 110 GHz</p></li><li><p>Digital Design Test (DDT) experience</p></li><li><p>On-wafer measurement experience</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with measurement simulation environments</p></li><li><p>Experience with Jira and Confluence</p></li><li><p>Dutch communication skills are desirable</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">What Benchmark Offers</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">At Benchmark, you work on products that truly matter. We are an organization where you are given freedom, where entrepreneurship is valued, and where you can turn your ideas into reality. We offer a dynamic environment that enables you to grow quickly, take ownership, and make a real impact. You become part of a global company while still enjoying the pragmatic and down-to-earth culture that defines our Almelo site.</p><p class="MsoNormal">In addition, we offer:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Competitive salary:</strong> A monthly gross salary ranging from <strong>€5.281,- to €7.010,-</strong> based on a full-time employment contract, depending on your experience and educational background.</p></li><li><p><strong>Quarterly bonus:</strong> Performance-based and linked to company results, with the opportunity to earn up to 5% of your quarterly salary.</p></li><li><p><strong>Excellent time off package:</strong> Enjoy 40 days off per year, consisting of 27 vacation days and 13 ATV days.</p></li><li><p><strong>Growth and development opportunities:</strong> Through our extensive Benchmark Academy training portfolio, as well as external courses and education programs aligned with both your ambitions and our business needs.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible working hours:</strong> We value results over rigid schedules and offer flexibility in organizing your workday.</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative learning culture:</strong> Through initiatives such as Lunch &amp; Learn sessions, we encourage knowledge sharing across teams. Our Pitch Discovery Sessions provide dedicated space to explore your own ideas, experiment with new technologies, and drive innovation.</p></li><li><p><strong>International high-tech environment:</strong> Work alongside talented colleagues across multiple disciplines and locations on complex and meaningful technology projects.</p></li><li><p><strong>A culture of ownership and innovation:</strong> We encourage continuous improvement, initiative, and the freedom to influence how we work and develop solutions.<br></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Interested?</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">We are looking for colleagues who can shape the future with us, inspire themselves and others with innovative technologies, take on new challenges, and develop forward-looking solutions. Does this sound like you?</p><p class="MsoNormal">For more information, please contact <strong>Nathan Seedorf</strong> via ----- class="MsoNormal">Have you become interested in working at a fast-growing and internationally operating high-tech organization? We look forward to receiving your application!</p><p class="MsoNormal">Providing a VOG (Certificate of Good Conduct) is an integral part of the application procedure at Benchmark.</p><p class="MsoNormal"><em>Acquisition is not appreciated. No rights or obligations can be derived from the introduction of candidates without an assignment from HR.</em></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong>Apply today and help us shape the next generation of RF and Test &amp; Measurement technology at Benchmark.</strong></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p> <br> <p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/benchmark/senior-c-firmware-engineer-vna-test-measurement-almelo-345197","tags":["Design Engineering"],"job_types":["Mid","contract"],"location":"Almelo, Overijssel, Nederland","created_at":1792669911},{"slug":"werkstudent-industrialisatie-engineering-pcba-almelo-253465","company_name":"Benchmark","title":"Werkstudent Industrialisatie Engineering PCBA","description":"<p class="MsoNoSpacing"><em>Als </em><strong><em>Werkstudent Industrialisatie Engineering PCBA</em></strong><em> ondersteun je onze Industrialisatie Engineers bij het introduceren van nieuwe producten. Je helpt bij praktische en administratieve werkzaamheden, zodat producten goed voorbereid de productie in gaan.</em></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><em>Jij brengt bij ons in de praktijk wat je tijdens je studie leert! Spreken we je snel?</em></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Jij draagt bij aan het voorbereiden, vastleggen en verbeteren van productieprocessen door onder andere werkinstructies op te stellen, technische documentatie te beheren en product- en procesgegevens te verwerken. Daarnaast ondersteun je tijdens de eerste productiebouw, controleer je onderdelen en documentatie en help je bij het voorbereiden van bedrading, tooling en werkplekken.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Wat ga je doen?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je werkt in een multifunctioneel klantenteam, waarbij je een of meerdere Industrialisatie Engineers ondersteunt bij de introductie van nieuwe producten (NPI).</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je stelt WPI’s op aan de hand van de door de Industrialisatie Engineers aangeleverde bouwvolgorde.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je ondersteunt bij het importeren en verwerken van klantdata, zodat deze geschikt is voor vastlegging in onze eigen systemen.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je ondersteunt bij het productiegereed maken van proto-orders.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je levert ondersteuning tijdens protobouw, verzamelt de feedback van operators en stemt die af met de Industrialisatie Engineer alvorens deze te verwerken in de WPI’s.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je levert input voor het proto evaluatierapport aan de Industrialisatie Engineer.</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNormal">Jij krijgt de kans om praktijkervaring op te doen met nieuwe productintroducties (NPI’s), technische documentatie en productieprocessen binnen onze high-tech manufacturing omgeving!</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Waar maak jij het verschil?</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je ontlast engineer bij uitvoerende werkzaamheden binnen NPI-projecten. Hierdoor neemt niet alleen efficiëntie toe, maar komt er ook meer ruimte voor procesoptimalisatie en (technische-) verbeterprojecten. Kortom; jij leert niet alleen van ons, wij leren ook van, en dankzij, jou!</p><p class="MsoNormal"><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p class="MsoNormal"><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Wat biedt Benchmark?</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je krijgt de kans om naast je studie relevante praktijkervaring op te doen binnen onze internationale high-tech organisatie. Je werkt samen met ervaren manufacturing engineers en krijgt inzicht in hoe nieuwe elektronische producten worden geïntroduceerd in een high-tech productieomgeving. Daarbij krijg je de ruimte om verantwoordelijkheid te nemen, nieuwe vaardigheden te ontwikkelen en de kennis uit je opleiding direct in de praktijk toe te passen. Je komt terecht in een informele en collegiale werkomgeving waar samenwerking, initiatief en persoonlijke ontwikkeling centraal staan. Zo bouw je niet alleen mee aan innovatieve producten, maar ook aan je eigen professionele ontwikkeling.</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">&nbsp;</p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Daarnaast bieden wij:</p><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong>Goed salaris:</strong> €3.064,- bruto per maand op fulltime basis.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong>Kwartaalbonus: </strong>deze is omzetafhankelijk en kan oplopen tot max. 5% van je kwartaalsalaris.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong>Vakantie: </strong>geniet van 40 vrije dagen per jaar op fulltime basis (27 vakantiedagen én 13 ATV-dagen).</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong>Ruimte voor groei- en ontwikkelingsmogelijkheden:</strong> bijvoorbeeld door deel te nemen aan één van de vele trainingen van onze Benchmark Academy.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong>Flexibele werktijden:</strong> zolang jij zorgt dat je werk af is, is er bij ons de mogelijkheid om op een flexibele manier je werktijden in te delen.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong>Deelname aan ons BE-Fit programma:</strong> sporten met collega’s op kosten van Benchmark. Samen hebben we al gekickbokst, cross-fit gedaan en padelclinics gevolgd.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Wat zien wij graag in onze toekomstige collega?</span></strong></p><ul><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je volgt een hbo- of wo-opleiding in de richting van Elektrotechniek, Electrical Engineering en je bent 1 tot 2 dagen per week beschikbaar.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je kunt technische tekeningen, schema's en documentatie lezen en begrijpen.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je werkt nauwkeurig en vindt het leuk om technische informatie overzichtelijk vast te leggen.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je beheerst de Nederlandse taal goed.</p></li><li><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Je bent leergierig en wilt ervaring opdoen in een high-tech productieomgeving.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Over ons</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing">Benchmark in Almelo maakt onderdeel uit van de multinational Benchmark Electronics Inc., een beursgenoteerde onderneming op het gebied van het vervaardigen van elektronica en het leveren van diensten richting original equipment manufacturers (OEM’s).&nbsp;<br><br>Bij ons werk je voor bedrijven die impact maken met hun innovaties. Zo ontwikkelen we nieuwe producten die de veiligheid of gezondheid verbeteren of juist het gemak vergroten. Deze producten worden geleverd vanaf het productontwerp tot en met volumeproductie en soms ook rechtstreeks aan de eindgebruiker. Dit proces wordt geheel in Almelo uitgevoerd.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p>Wereldwijd heeft Benchmark Electronics Inc. momenteel 23 vestigingen. Op onze vestiging in Almelo werken we samen met ongeveer 650 collega’s.</p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p style="min-height: 1.7em;"></p><p class="MsoNoSpacing"><strong><span style="color:#2F5496">Interesse?</span></strong></p><p><em>Wij zoeken collega’s die samen met ons de toekomst vorm geven, zichzelf en anderen inspireren, nieuwe uitdagingen aangaan en vooruitziende oplossingen bedenken.</em> Spreekt dit jou aan? We kijken uit naar je sollicitatie!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ben je op zoek naar meer informatie? Neem dan contact op met Nienke Bloemendaal via&nbsp;<a rel="noopener" target="_blank" ---------- je geïnteresseerd geraakt in het werken bij een snelgroeiende en internationaal opererende high-tech organisatie? <strong>Solliciteer direct</strong>!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Het verstrekken van een VOG is een vast onderdeel van de sollicitatieprocedure bij Benchmark.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>Acquisitie wordt niet op prijs gesteld. Aan het zonder opdracht, vanuit HR, voorstellen van kandidaten kunnen geen rechten c.q. verplichtingen worden ontleend.</em></p> <br> <p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/benchmark/werkstudent-industrialisatie-engineering-pcba-almelo-253465","tags":["Manufacturing Engineering"],"job_types":["Student college","parttime fixed term"],"location":"Almelo, Overijssel, Nederland","created_at":1792669911},{"slug":"software-integration-engineer-c-linux-almelo-39224","company_name":"Benchmark","title":"Software Integration Engineer (C++/Linux)","description":"<p class="MsoNormal">At Benchmark, we develop innovative technology solutions that help our customers bring advanced products to market. Our engineers work on complex systems in high-tech environments, contributing to products that require precision, performance, and reliability.</p><p class="MsoNormal">To support a strategic software migration and integration project, we are looking for a skilled <strong>Software Integration Engineer</strong> with strong C++ and Linux expertise who enjoys working on complex existing software systems and technical challenges.<br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">The Role</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">As a Software Integration Engineer, you will play a key role in the migration, integration, and verification of advanced Real-Time Spectrum Analyzer software. You will work within an international engineering team to port software between platforms, implement architectural modifications, validate functionality, and ensure performance requirements are maintained.</p><p class="MsoNormal">This position is ideal for an engineer who enjoys understanding large codebases, solving integration challenges, and improving software quality through structured validation and testing.</p><p class="MsoNormal">You will combine strong software engineering fundamentals with modern development practices, including the effective use of AI-assisted development tools such as GitHub Copilot and Cursor AI.<br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">Your Responsibilities</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Analyze and understand existing C++ software architectures and codebases</p></li><li><p>Execute software migration and platform porting activities on Linux-based environments</p></li><li><p>Implement software modifications, abstraction layers, and system integrations</p></li><li><p>Verify functional equivalence between existing and migrated software solutions</p></li><li><p>Develop, execute, and automate software validation and verification activities</p></li><li><p>Investigate and resolve integration, performance, and software quality issues</p></li><li><p>Perform debugging, troubleshooting, and root cause analysis</p></li><li><p>Collaborate with firmware, software, and system engineers across multiple locations</p></li><li><p>Translate technical specifications into robust implementations and validated results</p></li><li><p>Identify technical risks and integration challenges early in the development cycle</p></li><li><p>Contribute to technical documentation and engineering knowledge sharing</p></li><li><p>Apply AI-assisted development tools responsibly to improve productivity, code quality, testing, and documentation</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496"><br>What You Bring<br></span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">Required Qualifications</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Bachelor’s or master’s degree in software engineering, Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or a related technical field</p></li><li><p>Strong professional experience in C++ software development</p></li><li><p>Experience developing software for Linux environments</p></li><li><p>Proven ability to independently execute software development work packages</p></li><li><p>Experience working with large existing or legacy software systems</p></li><li><p>Strong debugging and troubleshooting capabilities</p></li><li><p>Experience with Git version control and CMake build environments</p></li><li><p>Ability to analyze requirements and translate them into working software solutions</p></li><li><p>Strong written and verbal communication skills in English</p></li><li><p>Experience using AI-assisted development tools such as GitHub Copilot, Cursor AI, or similar technologies<br></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">Preferred Qualifications</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Experience with Python and automated testing frameworks such as PyTest</p></li><li><p>Experience with software integration, platform migration, or software porting projects</p></li><li><p>Knowledge of signal processing concepts</p></li><li><p>Experience with FFT algorithms or DSP-related applications</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with SCPI communication protocols</p></li><li><p>Experience interfacing software with firmware or embedded systems</p></li><li><p>Experience with scientific, industrial, or measurement equipment software</p></li><li><p>Knowledge of numerical validation, performance testing, and automated verification<br></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">Nice to Have</span></strong></p><ul><li><p>Experience with Real-Time Spectrum Analyzer systems</p></li><li><p>FPGA integration experience</p></li><li><p>Knowledge of RF measurement systems</p></li><li><p>Experience with Conan package management</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with Jira and Confluence</p></li><li><p>Dutch language proficiency is desirable<br></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">What Benchmark Offers</span></strong></p><p class="MsoNormal">At Benchmark, you work on products that truly matter. We are an organization where you are given freedom, where entrepreneurship is valued, and where you can turn your ideas into reality. We offer a dynamic environment that enables you to grow quickly, take ownership, and make a real impact. You become part of a global company while still enjoying the pragmatic and down-to-earth culture that defines our Almelo site.</p><p class="MsoNormal">In addition, we offer:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Competitive salary</strong>: A monthly gross salary ranging from €5.281,- to €7.010,-&nbsp;to based on a full-time employment contract, depending on your experience and educational background.</p></li><li><p><strong>Quarterly bonus</strong>: Performance-based and linked to company results, with the opportunity to earn up to 5% of your quarterly salary.</p></li><li><p><strong>Excellent time off package</strong>: Enjoy 40 days off per year, consisting of 27 vacation days and 13 ATV days.</p></li><li><p><strong>Growth and development opportunities</strong>: Through our extensive Benchmark Academy training portfolio, as well as external courses and education programs aligned with both your ambitions and our business needs.</p></li><li><p><strong>Flexible working hours</strong>: We value results over rigid schedules and offer flexibility in organizing your workday.</p></li><li><p><strong>Collaborative learning culture</strong>: Through initiatives such as Lunch &amp; Learn sessions, we encourage knowledge sharing across teams. Our Pitch Discovery Sessions provide dedicated space to explore your own ideas, experiment with new technologies, and drive innovation.</p></li><li><p><strong>International high-tech environment</strong>: Work alongside talented colleagues across multiple disciplines and locations on complex and meaningful technology projects.</p></li><li><p><strong>A culture of ownership and innovation</strong>: We encourage continuous improvement, initiative, and the freedom to influence how we work and develop solutions.<br></p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="color:#2f5496">Interested?</span></strong><br>We<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>are<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>looking<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>for<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>colleagues<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>who<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>can<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>shape<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>the<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>future<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>with<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>us,<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>inspire<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>themselves<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>and<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>others<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>with<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>innovative<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>technologies,<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>take<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>on<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>new<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>challenges<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>and<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>come<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> up with </span>forward-<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF">looking </span>solutions.<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>Does<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>this<span style="background-color:#EFF6FF"> </span>appeal<span style="backgrou